('b9e2f578-7347-5d5b-bcea-c692958d70b1','b649d363-ad59-5207-b153-a815d7a09f7a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to do something to entertain people, for example by acting a play or playing a piece of music','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'اجرا کردن، به‌صحنه بردن (نمایش)؛ ایفای نقش؛ عملکرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Chenier and the band are performing at the Silver Palace tomorrow.","translation":"چنیر و گروه فردا در کاخ نقره ای اجرا دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000350235.mp3"},{"sentence":"The children perform two plays each school year.","translation":"بچه ها هر سال دو نمایش را اجرا می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559913.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('762b4209-a749-5410-aa04-0b57b2ad397f','b649d363-ad59-5207-b153-a815d7a09f7a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to do something, especially something difficult or useful','[ transitive ]',null,'انجام کاری مخصوصاً کاری دشوار یا مفید',array['carry out']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['perform a task/job/duty etc What skills do you need to perform this task?','perform work Over 6,000 people in our community of 100,000 perform volunteer work.','perform an experiment/study etc Part of the Chemistry exam involves performing an experiment.','perform an operation The surgeon who performed the operation said it had gone well.','perform a ceremony At 3 o''clock, the opening ceremony was performed by the Queen.','perform a service Our troops are performing a remarkable service and a terribly important mission.','perform a function/role The two organizations perform similar functions.','perform an action The children sing and perform the actions to nursery songs.','perform miracles (= do things that seem impossible ) I''m prepared to work hard to get the job done but I can''t perform miracles.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Surgeons performed an emergency operation.","translation":"جراحان یک عمل اورژانسی انجام دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000350240.mp3"},{"sentence":"The official opening ceremony was performed by Princess Margaret.","translation":"مراسم افتتاحیه رسمی توسط پرنسس مارگارت انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001765612.mp3"},{"sentence":"An analysis of the survey data was performed.","translation":"تجزیه و تحلیل داده های نظرسنجی انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559921.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was fired for not performing the duties outlined in her contract.","translation":"او به دلیل انجام ندادن وظایف مندرج در قراردادش اخراج شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559924.mp3"},{"sentence":"software that performs a specific function","translation":"نرم افزاری که عملکرد خاصی را انجام می دهد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559927.mp3"},{"sentence":"The leadership cannot be expected to perform miracles (= improve a situation in a way that seems impossible ) .","translation":"نمی توان از رهبری انتظار داشت که معجزه کند (= بهبود وضعیت به گونه ای که غیرممکن به نظر می رسد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559928.mp3"},{"sentence":"The operation was carried out by a team of surgeons.","translation":"این عمل توسط تیمی از جراحان انجام شد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
