('b24f176b-cf14-5d8c-a44e-44304453d42e','f651e6d2-ad94-59ee-bc72-2f9b5e7444d0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','liked by a lot of people',null,null,'محبوب، پرطرفدار؛ عامه‌پسند (نظر)؛ عمومی (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['very popular She was a very popular teacher.','extremely popular The restaurant is extremely popular, owing to its high standard of food.','highly popular (= extremely popular ) a highly popular radio station','immensely/hugely/enormously popular His plays were immensely popular.','wildly popular (= extremely popular – used especially about something that excites people ) These bands are wildly popular in Cuba.','phenomenally popular (= extremely popular, to a degree that is surprising or unusual ) Still her books remain phenomenally popular.','increasingly popular Business management courses are increasingly popular.','universally popular (= liked by everyone ) Some foods are universally popular.','enduringly/perennially popular (= always popular ) His most enduringly popular film is ‘Singin'' in the Rain’.','genuinely popular He became Russia''s first genuinely popular politician in a long time.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Hilary was popular at school.","translation":"هیلاری در مدرسه محبوب بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000309604.mp3"},{"sentence":"a popular holiday resort","translation":"یک استراحتگاه محبوب برای تعطیلات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636462.mp3"},{"sentence":"Coffee is probably the most popular drink in the world.","translation":"قهوه احتمالاً محبوب ترین نوشیدنی در جهان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636463.mp3"},{"sentence":"Guerrero’s music is hugely popular in Latin America.","translation":"موسیقی گوئررو در آمریکای لاتین بسیار محبوب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636466.mp3"},{"sentence":"The president is very popular with Jewish voters.","translation":"رئیس جمهور در بین رای دهندگان یهودی بسیار محبوب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636468.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('627a559d-3bc0-5abb-9abb-359385a54d0c','f651e6d2-ad94-59ee-bc72-2f9b5e7444d0',2,null,null,'spoken & written','done by a lot of people in a society , group etc','[ only before noun ]',null,'توسط افراد زیادی در یک جامعه، گروه و غیره انجام می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the closest popular vote in U.S. presidential history","translation":"نزدیک ترین رای مردمی در تاریخ ریاست جمهوری ایالات متحده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000309630.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government has little popular support among women voters.","translation":"دولت از حمایت مردمی کمی در میان رای دهندگان زن برخوردار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636469.mp3"},{"sentence":"Kaplan’s latest recording has received considerable popular acclaim (= it is liked by a lot of people ) .","translation":"آخرین ضبط کاپلان مورد تحسین مردمی قابل توجهی قرار گرفته است (= مورد پسند بسیاری از مردم است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636473.mp3"},{"sentence":"a survey of Hispanic-American popular opinion","translation":"نظرسنجی از افکار عمومی اسپانیایی-آمریکایی ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636486.mp3"},{"sentence":"Contrary to popular belief (= in spite of what many people believe ) , gorillas are basically shy, gentle creatures.","translation":"برخلاف تصور رایج (= علیرغم اعتقاد بسیاری از مردم)، گوریل ها اساسا موجوداتی خجالتی و مهربان هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636487.mp3"},{"sentence":"a popular movement for democracy","translation":"یک جنبش مردمی برای دموکراسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636491.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('8d6da59b-66bc-5f94-bee3-92fc0cfb9aaf','f651e6d2-ad94-59ee-bc72-2f9b5e7444d0',3,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to ordinary people, or intended for ordinary people','[ only before noun ]','pop music','مربوط به مردم عادی یا در نظر گرفته شده برای مردم عادی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Wintour’s writing is full of references to American popular culture .","translation":"نوشته وینتور مملو از ارجاعات به فرهنگ عامه آمریکایی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636495.mp3"},{"sentence":"Steele was ridiculed by the popular press.","translation":"استیل مورد تمسخر مطبوعات محبوب قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001636499.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d9788db5-4e34-5093-9d5d-8a213623b576','06527944-f375-5d93-942d-4321f6a287b3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a student who is popular at school, especially one who is part of a group of popular students',null,null,'دانش آموزی که در مدرسه محبوب است، به خصوص دانش آموزی که بخشی از گروهی از دانش آموزان محبوب است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"At high school she was one of the populars and everyone wanted to be her best friend.","translation":"در دبیرستان او یکی از محبوب ترین ها بود و همه می خواستند بهترین دوست او باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ld5_upd11_007.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('eddf035a-5e80-55d7-a691-324cae4dac0d','731d529d-803b-5fc7-8cd2-9881b2598fa0',1,null,null,'formal','to have a particular quality or ability',null,null,'دارا بودن؛ داشتن (ویژگی)؛ تسلط (بر نفس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Different workers possess different skills.","translation":"کارگران مختلف مهارت های متفاوتی دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576630.mp3"},{"sentence":"He no longer possessed the power to frighten her.","translation":"او دیگر قدرت ترساندن او را نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576631.mp3"},{"sentence":"They all have different skills.","translation":"همه آنها مهارت های متفاوتی دارند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('08f06e04-dc03-5e28-a9f4-4984cbd4cf3a','731d529d-803b-5fc7-8cd2-9881b2598fa0',2,null,null,'formal','to have or own something',null,null,'داشتن یا داشتن چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Neither of them possessed a credit card.","translation":"هیچ کدام از آنها کارت اعتباری نداشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576633.mp3"},{"sentence":"Campbell was found guilty of possessing heroin.","translation":"کمپبل به داشتن هروئین مجرم شناخته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000311761.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ae67ab8c-467a-5d66-9e38-f8929eb13e1f','731d529d-803b-5fc7-8cd2-9881b2598fa0',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'what possessed somebody (to do something)?','دارا بودن؛ داشتن (ویژگی)؛ تسلط (بر نفس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e89f798f-ab27-59dd-a073-90ced516a31b','731d529d-803b-5fc7-8cd2-9881b2598fa0',4,null,null,'literary','if a feeling possesses you, you suddenly feel it very strongly and it affects your behaviour',null,null,'اگر احساسی در شما وجود داشته باشد، ناگهان آن را به شدت احساس می کنید و بر رفتار شما تأثیر می گذارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A mad rage possessed her.","translation":"خشم دیوانه ای او را فرا گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576636.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f83b514e-24eb-5336-9039-0f0456ce47b5','9f9a7c72-930b-5e44-9c84-8c47dcb17929',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the situation or experience of being poor','[ uncountable ]',null,'فقر، تنگدستی؛ فقر (معنوی)؛ تنگ‌دستی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['live in poverty Half the world is living in poverty.','grow up in poverty No child should grow up in poverty in America in the 21st century.','die in poverty His art was not appreciated and he died in poverty.','be reduced to poverty (= become very poor ) By the end of the war, millions of people had been reduced to poverty.','fight/combat poverty (= take action to get rid of poverty ) The money should be spent on fighting poverty.','tackle poverty (= take action to reduce the amount of poverty ) Our priority is to tackle poverty and global inequality.','reduce poverty (= reduce the amount of poverty ) More must be done to reduce child poverty.','alleviate/relieve poverty formal (= make it less severe ) What has the West done to alleviate poverty in the world?','extreme/severe poverty They live in conditions of extreme poverty.','abject/grinding/dire poverty (= extremely severe ) He was shocked by the abject poverty that he saw.','relative poverty (= when someone is poor compared with someone else ) the relative poverty of the southern states','world poverty They campaigned for an end to world poverty.','urban/rural poverty People come to the capital seeking to escape rural poverty.','child poverty There is increasing child poverty in our country.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Millions of elderly people live in poverty .","translation":"میلیون ها سالمند در فقر زندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007903.mp3"},{"sentence":"We need an effective strategy to fight poverty .","translation":"ما به یک استراتژی موثر برای مبارزه با فقر نیاز داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007907.mp3"},{"sentence":"continued efforts to alleviate poverty and raise living standards","translation":"تلاش های مستمر برای کاهش فقر و افزایش استانداردهای زندگی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007911.mp3"},{"sentence":"scenes of abject poverty","translation":"صحنه های فقر مطلق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007915.mp3"},{"sentence":"the causes of urban poverty","translation":"علل فقر شهری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007918.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
