('fe5ecc3f-7098-53cd-bfc5-0cb6d522997c','a1293f99-ea76-5c1d-9484-365e5b18971d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something you give someone on a special occasion or to thank them for something','[ countable ]',null,'هدیه، پیشکش؛ (زمان حال) حالا',array['gift']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give somebody a present He gave everyone a present.','give something as a present I was given this book as a present.','buy somebody a present ( also get somebody a present informal ) I want to buy a present for Lucy but I’m not sure what she’d like. Did you get Bill a birthday present?','get a present (= receive a present ) Children soon learn to enjoy giving presents as well as getting them.','wrap a present She spent the afternoon wrapping Christmas presents.','open/unwrap a present Can we open our presents now?','exchange presents (= give each other a present ) We always exchange Christmas and birthday presents.','a birthday present Thanks for the birthday present.','a Christmas present What would Dad like as a Christmas present?','a wedding present His wedding present to her had been a diamond necklace.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m looking for a present for Mark.","translation":"من به دنبال هدیه ای برای مارک هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001244.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ce3d5994-19d1-5db4-8d2d-b822dff49dd8','a1293f99-ea76-5c1d-9484-365e5b18971d',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the present','هدیه، پیشکش؛ (زمان حال) حالا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give somebody a present He gave everyone a present.','give something as a present I was given this book as a present.','buy somebody a present ( also get somebody a present informal ) I want to buy a present for Lucy but I’m not sure what she’d like. Did you get Bill a birthday present?','get a present (= receive a present ) Children soon learn to enjoy giving presents as well as getting them.','wrap a present She spent the afternoon wrapping Christmas presents.','open/unwrap a present Can we open our presents now?','exchange presents (= give each other a present ) We always exchange Christmas and birthday presents.','a birthday present Thanks for the birthday present.','a Christmas present What would Dad like as a Christmas present?','a wedding present His wedding present to her had been a diamond necklace.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
