('1df9945a-ff68-56e3-9e53-b7b2a1288a1a','c008d742-9f4d-5631-8066-0ef97f7b2e00',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'privates',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('95caab72-3b12-5cb8-8048-395af48caf45','66306316-d06e-50b6-8914-a8eb4c69cb76',1,'difficulty','دشواری','spoken & written','a situation that causes difficulties',null,null,'مشکل، معضل؛ مسئله (ریاضی)؛ مشکل (حس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a problem We saw water rushing in and realised we had a serious problem.','cause/create a problem The building’s lack of parking space could cause problems.','present/pose a problem (= cause it or make it have to be considered ) A shortage of trained nurses is posing major problems.','deal with/sort out a problem The state has failed to deal with the problem of violence against women.','tackle/address a problem (= deal with it ) There is more than one way to tackle this problem.','solve/resolve a problem ( also fix a problem informal ) He solved his financial problems by selling his car.','overcome a problem We try to help families overcome housing problems.','face a problem Terrorism is possibly the most important problem facing western countries.','raise a problem (= mention it, so that people can discuss it ) He also raised the problem of noise from planes taking off and landing.','encounter/experience a problem You shouldn’t encounter any further problems.','a problem arises/occurs ( also a problem comes up ) (= it happens ) Problems may arise when the family wants to move house.','compound/exacerbate a problem formal (= make it worse ) The country’s economic problems are compounded by its ageing population.','the problem lies in/with something The problem lies in the design of the rocket.','big/major/serious The school’s biggest problem is a shortage of cash.','little/small/minor Old cars often develop minor engine problems.','the main problem The main problem for the climbers was lack of sleep.','a real problem They quickly found that their real problem lay with marketing.','a difficult problem Does the team have the skills to tackle these difficult problems?','a thorny/knotty problem (= difficult ) He still faced the thorny problem of finding a way out of the jungle.','a fundamental problem (= relating to the most basic and important parts of something ) The government has done little to solve the fundamental problems of poverty and crime.','a pressing problem (= one that needs to be dealt with very soon ) Lack of clean drinking water is the most pressing problem facing the refugees.','personal problems (= relating to your private life and relationships ) My daughter found it hard to talk about her personal problems.','family problems She would never discuss family problems with outsiders.','financial/money problems Our financial problems are over.','economic problems He argued that the government was to blame for the country’s economic problems.','a technical problem The delay was caused by technical problems.','a practical problem Burying a pet can present practical problems.','an environmental problem Air pollution is our most serious environmental problem.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was older than me, but that wasn’t really a problem.","translation":"او از من بزرگتر بود، اما این واقعاً مشکلی نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001248.mp3"},{"sentence":"The problem of street crime is getting worse every year.","translation":"معضل جرایم خیابانی هر سال بدتر می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001249.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve been having a few problems with my car.","translation":"من با ماشینم چند مشکل داشتم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941831.mp3"},{"sentence":"the issue of race relations","translation":"موضوع روابط نژادی","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('4a93bd07-d62a-59d0-b863-c2e8f7c5664f','66306316-d06e-50b6-8914-a8eb4c69cb76',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something wrong with your health or with part of your body',null,null,'مشکلی برای سلامتی یا بخشی از بدن شما وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Does she have any long-term health problems?","translation":"آیا او مشکلات سلامتی طولانی مدت دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941875.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you have back problems you should avoid lifting heavy objects.","translation":"اگر مشکل کمر دارید باید از بلند کردن اجسام سنگین خودداری کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941878.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many people with hearing problems try to hide their condition.","translation":"بسیاری از افرادی که مشکلات شنوایی دارند سعی می کنند وضعیت خود را پنهان کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941881.mp3"},{"sentence":"She refuses to admit to herself that she has a weight problem.","translation":"او حاضر نیست به خودش اعتراف کند که مشکل وزن دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941884.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is this a sign of some kind of deeper psychological problem?","translation":"آیا این نشانه نوعی مشکل روانی عمیق تر است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941887.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('f3c18904-cc0a-56dd-9370-b05e8b607b80','66306316-d06e-50b6-8914-a8eb4c69cb76',3,'question','سوال','spoken & written','a question for which you have to find the right answer , using mathematics or careful thought',null,null,'سوالی که باید با استفاده از ریاضیات یا تفکر دقیق پاسخ مناسب را برای آن بیابید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She gave us 20 mathematical problems to solve.","translation":"او 20 مسئله ریاضی را به ما داد تا حل کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000294956.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
