('03192233-ecd5-58b1-8be7-7b7c8b5fe8f2','f5a3bd39-8fc1-5b64-9a3e-e2185b5b3be0',4,null,null,'formal','to move in a particular direction','[ always +adv/preposition ]',null,'برای حرکت در یک جهت خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Passengers for Miami should proceed to gate 25.","translation":"مسافران میامی باید به سمت دروازه 25 حرکت کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000295092.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4c0b3151-ed00-585e-b385-27cff2d7e089','3042260e-1740-5d41-830c-524441a2d372',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a series of actions that are done in order to achieve a particular result',null,null,'فرایند، روند؛ فرایند (طبیعت)؛ پروسه (کمون)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['slow Collecting the data is a slow process.','long/lengthy Try to be patient through the long process of healing.','laborious (= taking a lot of time and effort ) The copying of manuscripts was a laborious process.','complex Getting a visa can be a complex process.','a natural process Birth is a natural process.','a formal process A decision will only be taken after a formal consultation process.','a mental process Cats have different mental processes from dogs.','the learning process The student is actively involved in the learning process.','the peace process They are frustrated with the lack of progress in the peace process.','the decision-making process Not all staff can participate in the decision-making process.','a selection process An interview normally forms part of the selection process.','go through a process ( also undergo a process formal ) (= experience a process ) A lot of companies are going through a process of change. The system underwent a process of simplification.','take part in a process ( also participate in a process ) We encourage our clients to participate in the process at every stage.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the Israeli–Egyptian peace process","translation":"روند صلح اسرائیل و مصر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561325.mp3"},{"sentence":"Repetition can help the learning process.","translation":"تکرار می تواند به فرآیند یادگیری کمک کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561328.mp3"},{"sentence":"the process of economic change","translation":"روند تغییرات اقتصادی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561334.mp3"},{"sentence":"Getting fit again has been a long slow process.","translation":"تناسب اندام دوباره یک روند طولانی و کند بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561335.mp3"},{"sentence":"the mental processes involved in decision-making","translation":"فرآیندهای ذهنی درگیر در تصمیم گیری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561339.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('080296bd-1687-5205-adfa-cb260cb027c7','3042260e-1740-5d41-830c-524441a2d372',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a series of things that happen naturally and result in gradual change',null,null,'مجموعه ای از چیزهایی که به طور طبیعی اتفاق می افتد و منجر به تغییر تدریجی می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['slow Collecting the data is a slow process.','long/lengthy Try to be patient through the long process of healing.','laborious (= taking a lot of time and effort ) The copying of manuscripts was a laborious process.','complex Getting a visa can be a complex process.','a natural process Birth is a natural process.','a formal process A decision will only be taken after a formal consultation process.','a mental process Cats have different mental processes from dogs.','the learning process The student is actively involved in the learning process.','the peace process They are frustrated with the lack of progress in the peace process.','the decision-making process Not all staff can participate in the decision-making process.','a selection process An interview normally forms part of the selection process.','go through a process ( also undergo a process formal ) (= experience a process ) A lot of companies are going through a process of change. The system underwent a process of simplification.','take part in a process ( also participate in a process ) We encourage our clients to participate in the process at every stage.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the natural process of evolution","translation":"روند طبیعی تکامل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561345.mp3"},{"sentence":"Coal forms by a slow process of chemical change.","translation":"زغال سنگ در اثر یک فرآیند آهسته تغییر شیمیایی تشکیل می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000295781.mp3"},{"sentence":"the digestive process","translation":"فرآیند گوارش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000295782.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
