('4c9bb9cb-58c0-5ff9-9f28-ef9d94f8a6d3','f25725a5-8f0b-550a-a7c7-05bbc9a171f1',6,'baby','عزیزم','spoken & written','to give birth to a baby or young animals',null,null,'برای به دنیا آوردن نوزاد یا حیوانات جوان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"An adult cat may produce kittens three times a year.","translation":"یک گربه بالغ ممکن است سه بار در سال بچه گربه تولید کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000296326.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b98b954a-83c4-540e-a61e-ec25c540a6be','547e4245-e75f-5186-b72f-1299112fef93',1,null,null,'spoken & written','food or other things that have been grown or produced on a farm to be sold',null,null,'غذا یا چیزهای دیگری که در مزرعه رشد کرده یا تولید شده اند تا به فروش برسند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['organic produce (= produced without artificial chemicals ) There is increased demand for organic produce.','agricultural/farm produce The government bought surplus agricultural produce from farmers.','garden produce She had filled a basket with her garden produce.','local produce Local produce is used wherever possible.','fresh produce Wash all fresh produce before use.','dairy produce British English (= milk, butter, cheese etc ) Vitamin A can also be obtained from dairy produce and eggs.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"fresh local produce","translation":"محصولات تازه محلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001843154.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2ea80890-5167-596b-ba58-244edd5e4bb6','392024b4-3588-53f3-989e-1ca26b9380c6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is grown or made in a factory in large quantities , usually in order to be sold','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'محصول، فراورده؛ محصول (کار)؛ برآیند (ضرب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a commercial product They help firms turn good ideas into commercial products.','a consumer product (= one that is bought by the public ) Demand for consumer products has increased.','household products Do you know what chemicals are in household products such as washing powder and paint?','beauty/hair products She doesn’t buy beauty products that have been tested on animals.','dairy/milk products Some people are allergic to dairy products.','meat products meat products like sausages, pies and burgers','the finished product The quality of the finished product is all-important.','product development The money will be used to fund product development.','a product range/line (= the range of things that a company makes and sells ) We want to broaden the company’s product line.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"consumer products such as VCRs","translation":"محصولات مصرفی مانند VCR","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000297977.mp3"},{"sentence":"The London factory assembles the finished product .","translation":"کارخانه لندن محصول نهایی را مونتاژ می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561514.mp3"},{"sentence":"He works in marketing and product development.","translation":"او در زمینه بازاریابی و توسعه محصول فعالیت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000297978.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
