('1b1012b7-dbf7-58f4-a188-487b2a1910e5','7feacc3b-62a9-5d8e-a99f-1ebaf5e24452',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a set of instructions given to a computer to make it perform an operation',null,null,'برنامه (رایانه)؛ برنامه‌ریزی (ورزش)؛ برنامه (رادیو)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a computer program The pictures were generated by a computer program.','a software program a software program that aids in website design','a spreadsheet program (= one that can do calculations with numbers ) A spreadsheet program doesn''t replace the traditional accounts package.','a word processing program (= one that you use for writing documents ) All word processing programs can check your spelling.','an anti-virus program You should update your anti-virus program regularly.','write a program They learned how to write their own programs.','run a program You have to input this information every time you run the program.','use a program The documentation explains how to use the program.','load/install a program (= put it on your computer ) Is that program installed on your computer?','download a program You can download the program and use it free of charge for 90 days.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a word-processing program","translation":"یک برنامه پردازش کلمه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00687.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4c353df1-2abb-5d15-a5ca-66176156faa8','7feacc3b-62a9-5d8e-a99f-1ebaf5e24452',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the American spelling of programme',null,null,'املای برنامه آمریکایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a computer program The pictures were generated by a computer program.','a software program a software program that aids in website design','a spreadsheet program (= one that can do calculations with numbers ) A spreadsheet program doesn''t replace the traditional accounts package.','a word processing program (= one that you use for writing documents ) All word processing programs can check your spelling.','an anti-virus program You should update your anti-virus program regularly.','write a program They learned how to write their own programs.','run a program You have to input this information every time you run the program.','use a program The documentation explains how to use the program.','load/install a program (= put it on your computer ) Is that program installed on your computer?','download a program You can download the program and use it free of charge for 90 days.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0384cd6f-0f9f-5754-9dc2-b1eb76a49e4d','d9b552b7-b232-5b01-bda9-f46e256c5b4b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to give a computer a set of instructions that it can use to perform a particular operation',null,null,'دادن مجموعه ای از دستورالعمل ها به رایانه که بتواند از آنها برای انجام یک عملیات خاص استفاده کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"attempts to program computers to produce and understand speech","translation":"تلاش برای برنامه ریزی کامپیوترها برای تولید و درک گفتار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299157.mp3"},{"sentence":"Any large high-speed computer can be programmed to learn.","translation":"هر کامپیوتر پرسرعت بزرگی را می توان برای یادگیری برنامه ریزی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001574931.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8ac8d1c2-2b62-59b0-b82a-b1931e01c7f5','d9b552b7-b232-5b01-bda9-f46e256c5b4b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the American spelling of programme',null,null,'املای برنامه آمریکایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0c4e9d3c-e9a2-543d-a03c-ac449a30d26d','4592258b-048d-59b0-a9da-552e6ebb6064',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a carefully planned piece of work to get information about something, to build something, to improve something etc',null,null,'پروژه، طرح (پژوهشی)؛ پروژه (تخصصی)؛ پروژه (خوب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a research project The aim of this research project is to study modern food habits.','a construction project Spending on new construction projects has been reduced.','a development project Our aim is assess the environmental impact of new development projects.','a pilot project (= one organized to test if an idea will be successful ) These changes were shelved after pilot projects showed poor results.','a major project The company is funding a major research project into the causes of addiction.','an ambitious project Young people often enjoy the challenge of an ambitious project.','successful Was the project successful?','work on a project A team has been working on the project for three years.','be involved in a project I am involved in various projects.','set up a project (= organize it ) $30 million would be required to set up the project.','embark on a project (= start it ) He was embarking on the biggest project of his career.','complete a project The project was completed on time.','a project manager/leader The project manager is responsible for sorting this out.','a phase/stage of a project The first phase of the project was due to be completed by the end of 2008.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The project aims to provide an analysis of children’s emotions.","translation":"هدف این پروژه ارائه تحلیلی از احساسات کودکان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582971.mp3"},{"sentence":"a three-year research project","translation":"یک پروژه تحقیقاتی سه ساله","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299614.mp3"},{"sentence":"The scheme will now be extended after a successful pilot project (= a small trial to test if an idea will be successful ) .","translation":"این طرح اکنون پس از یک پروژه آزمایشی موفق (= یک آزمایش کوچک برای آزمایش موفقیت آمیز بودن ایده) تمدید خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001765923.mp3"},{"sentence":"a project to develop a substitute for oil","translation":"پروژه ای برای توسعه جایگزینی برای نفت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582962.mp3"},{"sentence":"The project is funded by Wellcome plc.","translation":"این پروژه توسط Wellcome plc تامین مالی می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299615.mp3"},{"sentence":"a project manager","translation":"یک مدیر پروژه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582975.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('bc8e9fc3-cebc-52ef-919c-630f507767ec','4592258b-048d-59b0-a9da-552e6ebb6064',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a part of a school or college course that involves careful study of a particular subject over a period of time',null,null,'بخشی از یک دوره مدرسه یا کالج که شامل مطالعه دقیق یک موضوع خاص در یک دوره زمانی خاص است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a research project The aim of this research project is to study modern food habits.','a construction project Spending on new construction projects has been reduced.','a development project Our aim is assess the environmental impact of new development projects.','a pilot project (= one organized to test if an idea will be successful ) These changes were shelved after pilot projects showed poor results.','a major project The company is funding a major research project into the causes of addiction.','an ambitious project Young people often enjoy the challenge of an ambitious project.','successful Was the project successful?','work on a project A team has been working on the project for three years.','be involved in a project I am involved in various projects.','set up a project (= organize it ) $30 million would be required to set up the project.','embark on a project (= start it ) He was embarking on the biggest project of his career.','complete a project The project was completed on time.','a project manager/leader The project manager is responsible for sorting this out.','a phase/stage of a project The first phase of the project was due to be completed by the end of 2008.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’re doing a project on pollution.","translation":"ما در حال انجام پروژه ای در زمینه آلودگی هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299621.mp3"},{"sentence":"a geography project","translation":"یک پروژه جغرافیایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582981.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('c4ede60a-882e-531c-b739-bd3c9fdd22e7','4592258b-048d-59b0-a9da-552e6ebb6064',3,null,null,'informal','a housing project',null,null,'یک پروژه مسکن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a research project The aim of this research project is to study modern food habits.','a construction project Spending on new construction projects has been reduced.','a development project Our aim is assess the environmental impact of new development projects.','a pilot project (= one organized to test if an idea will be successful ) These changes were shelved after pilot projects showed poor results.','a major project The company is funding a major research project into the causes of addiction.','an ambitious project Young people often enjoy the challenge of an ambitious project.','successful Was the project successful?','work on a project A team has been working on the project for three years.','be involved in a project I am involved in various projects.','set up a project (= organize it ) $30 million would be required to set up the project.','embark on a project (= start it ) He was embarking on the biggest project of his career.','complete a project The project was completed on time.','a project manager/leader The project manager is responsible for sorting this out.','a phase/stage of a project The first phase of the project was due to be completed by the end of 2008.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7718be7d-1a28-5c33-afeb-8d551d9c3008','6944fcda-7017-5663-b4a0-265ea9b6e0ce',1,'calculate','محاسبه کنید','spoken & written','to calculate what something will be in the future, using the information you have now','[ transitive ]',null,'با استفاده از اطلاعاتی که اکنون دارید، محاسبه کنید که چیزی در آینده چه خواهد شد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company projected an annual growth rate of 3%.","translation":"این شرکت رشد سالانه 3 درصدی را پیش بینی کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299644.mp3"},{"sentence":"projected sales figures","translation":"ارقام فروش پیش بینی شده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299645.mp3"},{"sentence":"Total expenditure is projected to rise by 25%.","translation":"پیش بینی می شود کل هزینه ها 25 درصد افزایش یابد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582984.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
