('c729fd31-eaf6-5f0a-b5f1-e993ee606579','bb8acfe3-2348-5be0-b2da-b34b4b15b3b3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a statement that you will definitely do or provide something or that something will definitely happen','[ countable ]',null,'قول، وعده؛ وعده (کاراتر)؛ نوید (موفقیت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a promise I made a promise to my mother that I’d look after Dad.','keep a promise ( also fulfil a promise British English , fulfill a promise American English formal ) (= do what you promised to do ) She said she would come back, and she kept her promise. The mayor has fulfilled his promise to get tough on corruption.','break a promise (= not do what you promised to do ) Once again, the government has broken its promises.','go back on your promise (= break it ) They were angry that the company had gone back on its promise.','renege on a promise formal (= break it ) It is tempting for the government to renege on its promise.','have somebody’s promise (= they have promised you something ) ‘It’ll remain a secret?’ ‘Yes, you have my promise.’','hold somebody to their promise (= make them keep it ) The next day, Gareth held me to my promise to take him fishing.','a solemn promise As governor, I made a solemn promise to defend the laws of the Republic.','a firm promise (= definite ) What had happened to all those firm promises of help?','a vague promise (= not definite ) Larry made some vague promises to leave his wife.','a false/empty/hollow promise (= one that will not be kept ) I didn’t make any false promises.','a broken promise (= one that has not been kept ) There have been too many broken promises.','a campaign/election promise He was accused of breaking a campaign promise not to raise taxes.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We received promises of support from several MPs.","translation":"از چند نماینده مجلس قول حمایت گرفتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001257.mp3"},{"sentence":"He would never break his promise to his father.","translation":"او هرگز عهد خود را با پدرش زیر پا نمی گذارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001258.mp3"},{"sentence":"She made a promise to visit them once a month.","translation":"او قول داد که ماهی یک بار به آنها سر بزند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583120.mp3"},{"sentence":"I received a promise that this would not happen again.","translation":"من قول گرفتم که دیگر این اتفاق نخواهد افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00690.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('79983b0f-14f3-5569-bc36-b542562edcce','bb8acfe3-2348-5be0-b2da-b34b4b15b3b3',2,null,null,'spoken & written','signs that something or someone will be good or successful','[ uncountable ]',null,'نشانه هایی از اینکه چیزی یا کسی خوب یا موفق خواهد بود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a young man full of promise","translation":"جوانی پر از وعده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000300688.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bill shows great promise as a goalkeeper.","translation":"بیل به عنوان یک دروازه بان قول بسیار خوبی را نشان می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583128.mp3"},{"sentence":"She didn’t fulfil her early promise .","translation":"او به قول اولیه خود عمل نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583132.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ea047023-06a3-5336-a007-4eb6542a1a9c','bb8acfe3-2348-5be0-b2da-b34b4b15b3b3',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a sign that something, usually something good, may happen','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'نشانه این است که ممکن است چیزی، معمولاً اتفاق خوبی رخ دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the promise of spring","translation":"نوید بهار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583144.mp3"},{"sentence":"The letter gave a promise of greater happiness.","translation":"نامه نوید خوشبختی بیشتر را می داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583145.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('cbc35799-80c7-5a51-b99b-d90f4993c306','a203450a-bcb2-5d0d-a7e2-a9f01b20b3bb',1,'encourage','تشویق کنند','spoken & written','to help something to develop or increase',null,null,'ارتقاء دادن، تقویت کردن (توسعه)؛ تبلیغ کردن (کالا)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a meeting to promote international trade","translation":"نشستی برای ارتقای تجارت بین المللی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000300773.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fertilizer promotes leaf growth.","translation":"کود باعث رشد برگ می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000300774.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
