('89b1de3c-1bf9-55a3-b12a-73063c2d295a','7d9a8dd3-5689-53ed-b05a-9d157cb946ef',1,null,null,'spoken & written','without making much noise',null,null,'به‌طور آرام، بی‌صدا؛ به‌نحو خفیف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Rosa shut the door quietly.","translation":"رزا بی صدا در را بست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583382.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘I’m sorry, ’ she said quietly.","translation":"او به آرامی گفت: متاسفم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583383.mp3"},{"sentence":"a quietly-spoken man (= one who always speaks quietly )","translation":"مردی که آرام صحبت می کند (= کسی که همیشه آرام صحبت می کند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583384.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('c8abc727-402a-5597-bcb1-3cadf9ee590d','7d9a8dd3-5689-53ed-b05a-9d157cb946ef',2,null,null,'spoken & written','in a way that does not attract attention',null,null,'به گونه ای که جلب توجه نمی کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The mayor had been aiming to quietly turn over control of the city’s water to private business interests.","translation":"شهردار قصد داشت کنترل آب شهر را بی سر و صدا به منافع تجاری خصوصی بسپارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000468210.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government hoped that their early mishandling of the crisis could be quietly forgotten .","translation":"دولت امیدوار بود که مدیریت نادرست اولیه آنها از بحران به آرامی فراموش شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583392.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('eb42dab5-fb0a-5dae-9885-d020dd065838','7d9a8dd3-5689-53ed-b05a-9d157cb946ef',3,null,null,'spoken & written','without protesting , complaining , or fighting',null,null,'بدون اعتراض، شکایت و دعوا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Now are you gonna come quietly , or do I have to use force?","translation":"حالا میای بی سر و صدا بیای یا باید زور بزنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583396.mp3"},{"sentence":"Speculation is growing that Grogan will be replaced at the end of the season, and he is unlikely to go quietly .","translation":"گمانه زنی ها مبنی بر تعویض گروگان در پایان فصل در حال افزایش است و بعید است که او بی سر و صدا برود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583400.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3c0eb40c-8fd1-5c35-86dd-4465093b3c77','7d9a8dd3-5689-53ed-b05a-9d157cb946ef',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'quietly confident','به‌طور آرام، بی‌صدا؛ به‌نحو خفیف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ec850d55-4850-5957-82e1-8e70f42212f8','115252e4-5a35-5769-b055-a41358ea8b21',1,'change/difference','تغییر/تفاوت','spoken & written','a radical change or difference is very big and important',null,null,'بنیادی، ریشه‌ای (تغییر)؛ اساسی (عقاید)؛ افراطی (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a radical change If that offer is serious, it will mark a radical change in policy.','a radical transformation (= a complete change in appearance, especially when this is an improvement ) The city has undergone a radical transformation.','radical measures (= extreme actions ) Instead of retreating, he suggested even more radical measures.','radical reform (= big changes to a system or organization in order to improve it ) He said the institution was in need of radical reform.','a radical overhaul (= big changes in order to improve something ) government plans for a radical overhaul of the health care system','a radical difference There is a radical difference between this and other dieting methods.','a radical departure (= something very different ) The design of the building is a radical departure from tradition.','a radical rethink (= when you think about a plan or idea again in a very different way ) The Conservative Party leader called for a radical rethink of economic policy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They are proposing radical changes to the way the company is run.","translation":"آنها تغییرات اساسی در نحوه اداره شرکت پیشنهاد می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000470297.mp3"},{"sentence":"a radical reform of the tax system","translation":"اصلاحات اساسی در نظام مالیاتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000470298.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are radical differences between the two organizations.","translation":"بین این دو سازمان تفاوت های اساسی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571029.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8e15e341-cb08-512c-8457-ae8beed6b186','115252e4-5a35-5769-b055-a41358ea8b21',2,'opinions','نظرات','spoken & written','radical ideas are very new and different, and are against what most people think or believe',null,null,'ایده‌های رادیکال بسیار جدید و متفاوت هستند و بر خلاف آن چیزی هستند که اکثر مردم فکر می‌کنند یا معتقدند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a radical change If that offer is serious, it will mark a radical change in policy.','a radical transformation (= a complete change in appearance, especially when this is an improvement ) The city has undergone a radical transformation.','radical measures (= extreme actions ) Instead of retreating, he suggested even more radical measures.','radical reform (= big changes to a system or organization in order to improve it ) He said the institution was in need of radical reform.','a radical overhaul (= big changes in order to improve something ) government plans for a radical overhaul of the health care system','a radical difference There is a radical difference between this and other dieting methods.','a radical departure (= something very different ) The design of the building is a radical departure from tradition.','a radical rethink (= when you think about a plan or idea again in a very different way ) The Conservative Party leader called for a radical rethink of economic policy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He has put forward some very radical ideas .","translation":"او ایده های بسیار رادیکالی را مطرح کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000470302.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was shocked by her radical views.","translation":"من از نظرات رادیکال او شوکه شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571037.mp3"},{"sentence":"a radical approach to education","translation":"رویکرد رادیکال به آموزش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571038.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('329e91cb-1d53-5bb2-b52c-9911d93f1ddb','115252e4-5a35-5769-b055-a41358ea8b21',3,'people','مردم','spoken & written','someone who is radical has ideas that are very new and different, and against what most people think or believe',null,null,'کسی که رادیکال است، عقایدی دارد که بسیار جدید و متفاوت است و برخلاف آن چیزی است که اکثر مردم فکر می کنند یا معتقدند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a radical change If that offer is serious, it will mark a radical change in policy.','a radical transformation (= a complete change in appearance, especially when this is an improvement ) The city has undergone a radical transformation.','radical measures (= extreme actions ) Instead of retreating, he suggested even more radical measures.','radical reform (= big changes to a system or organization in order to improve it ) He said the institution was in need of radical reform.','a radical overhaul (= big changes in order to improve something ) government plans for a radical overhaul of the health care system','a radical difference There is a radical difference between this and other dieting methods.','a radical departure (= something very different ) The design of the building is a radical departure from tradition.','a radical rethink (= when you think about a plan or idea again in a very different way ) The Conservative Party leader called for a radical rethink of economic policy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a radical left-wing politician","translation":"یک سیاستمدار چپ افراطی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571040.mp3"},{"sentence":"a radical feminist","translation":"یک فمینیست رادیکال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571041.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
