('5bf4b6d8-8aee-5d96-ba8a-2335d6983da6','1f03be0c-3dd4-5b99-9e63-d30db6580c5c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to start doing something instead of another person, or start being used instead of another thing',null,null,'جایگزین کردن، عوض کردن (با)؛ جانشین کردن (شغل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m replacing Sue on the team.","translation":"من جایگزین سو در تیم هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776240.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lectures have replaced the old tutorial system.","translation":"سخنرانی ها جایگزین سیستم آموزشی قدیمی شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776241.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a2c2d1b1-d8eb-5140-97a3-2723904d75b1','1f03be0c-3dd4-5b99-9e63-d30db6580c5c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to remove someone from their job or something from its place, and put a new person or thing there',null,null,'کسی را از کار یا چیزی از جای خود برکنار کردن و شخص یا چیز جدیدی را در آنجا قرار داد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Two of the tyres had to be replaced.","translation":"دو تا از لاستیک ها باید تعویض می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562729.mp3"},{"sentence":"They replaced the permanent staff with part-timers.","translation":"کارکنان دائمی را جایگزین کارکنان پاره وقت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776248.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('63232bf7-3dff-54a9-8d13-d5855cc074f2','1f03be0c-3dd4-5b99-9e63-d30db6580c5c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if you replace something that has been broken, stolen etc, you get a new one',null,null,'اگر چیزی را که شکسته، دزدیده شده و غیره جایگزین کنید، یک مورد جدید دریافت می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ll replace the vase I broke as soon as possible.","translation":"گلدانی که شکستم را در اسرع وقت تعویض خواهم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776252.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('21477081-ef5f-53ce-bea6-09a8286bc6dc','1f03be0c-3dd4-5b99-9e63-d30db6580c5c',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to put something back where it was before',null,null,'برای برگرداندن چیزی به جایی که قبلا بود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He replaced the book on the shelf.","translation":"کتاب روی قفسه را عوض کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776256.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c03b3a7a-a050-56c5-b374-62ca513f1c57','650bc3dc-8cef-5b30-9a3c-454441a0c6fa',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a polite or formal demand for something',null,null,'درخواست، خواهش؛ درخواست (رسمی)؛ درخواست (نرم‌افزار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a request I’d like to make a request.','submit/put in a request (= make a formal request ) The request was first submitted a number of months ago. He has put in a request for two weeks'' holiday.','agree to a request ( also grant somebody’s request formal ) The judge granted his request. Diana was happy to agree to his request.','refuse/reject a request ( also turn down somebody’s request ) He rejected their request for a meeting. This request was turned down because of the cost.','receive a request They had received two urgent requests for assistance.','consider a request After carefully considering this request, the council rejected it.','respond to a request Thank you to those who responded to our request for information last month.','ignore a request They ignored repeated requests to leave the property.','a formal request The government made a formal request for food aid.','a special request Do you have any special requests?','an urgent request The family made an urgent request on television for help in finding their daughter.','a reasonable request It seemed like a reasonable request.','a strange/unusual request This is rather an unusual request.','a written request If you wish to take you child on holiday during the school term, you must make a formal written request.','repeated requests The bank would not reveal its figures, despite repeated requests.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They have made an urgent request for international aid.","translation":"آنها درخواست فوری کمک بین المللی کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000777718.mp3"},{"sentence":"requests from customers for more information","translation":"درخواست مشتریان برای اطلاعات بیشتر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001336.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anderson repeated his request that we postpone the meeting.","translation":"اندرسون درخواست خود را برای به تعویق انداختن جلسه تکرار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000777721.mp3"},{"sentence":"The study was done at the request of the Chairman.","translation":"مطالعه به درخواست رئیس انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607240.mp3"},{"sentence":"Further details will be sent on request.","translation":"جزئیات بیشتر در صورت درخواست ارسال خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607244.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were no flowers at the funeral, by request.","translation":"بنا به درخواست، در تشییع جنازه گلی وجود نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607247.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('1ca47a63-8614-5e06-bba5-e5e83f4f474d','650bc3dc-8cef-5b30-9a3c-454441a0c6fa',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of music that is played on the radio because someone has asked for it',null,null,'یک قطعه موسیقی که از رادیو پخش می شود زیرا کسی آن را خواسته است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a request I’d like to make a request.','submit/put in a request (= make a formal request ) The request was first submitted a number of months ago. He has put in a request for two weeks'' holiday.','agree to a request ( also grant somebody’s request formal ) The judge granted his request. Diana was happy to agree to his request.','refuse/reject a request ( also turn down somebody’s request ) He rejected their request for a meeting. This request was turned down because of the cost.','receive a request They had received two urgent requests for assistance.','consider a request After carefully considering this request, the council rejected it.','respond to a request Thank you to those who responded to our request for information last month.','ignore a request They ignored repeated requests to leave the property.','a formal request The government made a formal request for food aid.','a special request Do you have any special requests?','an urgent request The family made an urgent request on television for help in finding their daughter.','a reasonable request It seemed like a reasonable request.','a strange/unusual request This is rather an unusual request.','a written request If you wish to take you child on holiday during the school term, you must make a formal written request.','repeated requests The bank would not reveal its figures, despite repeated requests.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('957d5281-b505-532c-9a28-cd6a8220f5ca','cfda1a0f-5ec4-51a5-964b-c585fd7f205c',1,null,null,'formal','to ask for something in a polite or formal way',null,null,'درخواست چیزی به شکلی مودبانه یا رسمی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"To request more information, please call our toll-free number.","translation":"برای درخواست اطلاعات بیشتر، لطفا با شماره تلفن رایگان ما تماس بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00728.mp3"},{"sentence":"You have to request permission if you want to take any photographs.","translation":"اگر می خواهید عکس بگیرید، باید اجازه بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607253.mp3"},{"sentence":"The prosecution has requested that all charges against Hodgkins be dropped.","translation":"دادستانی درخواست کرده است که همه اتهامات علیه هوچکینز لغو شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00729.mp3"},{"sentence":"All club members are requested to attend the annual meeting.","translation":"از کلیه اعضای باشگاه درخواست می شود در جلسه سالانه شرکت کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607261.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Police Committee requested a grant from the Government to cover the extra expense.","translation":"کمیته پلیس برای پوشش هزینه های اضافی از دولت درخواست کمک مالی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000777761.mp3"},{"sentence":"I requested permission to leave early.","translation":"اجازه خواستم زودتر بروم.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"They request that he finishes the work by Friday.","translation":"آنها درخواست می کنند که او کار را تا جمعه تمام کند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"She requested that she be allowed to leave.","translation":"او درخواست کرد که اجازه خروج داشته باشد.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Passengers are requested not to throw things out of the window.","translation":"از مسافران تقاضا می شود وسایل را از پنجره به بیرون پرتاب نکنند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,9),
('0404ce37-0e87-56cd-94fd-e1485f569f76','2b364b97-a8a7-5d03-a94a-fef85622304f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to need something',null,null,'نیاز داشتن، طلب کردن (شرط)؛ اقتضا کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Campbell’s broken leg will probably require surgery.","translation":"پای شکسته کمپل احتمالاً به جراحی نیاز دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607264.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s required is a complete reorganization of the system.","translation":"آنچه مورد نیاز است، سازماندهی مجدد کامل سیستم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000777835.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most houseplants require regular watering.","translation":"اکثر گیاهان آپارتمانی نیاز به آبیاری منظم دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00730.mp3"},{"sentence":"His leg will probably need surgery.","translation":"پای او احتمالا نیاز به جراحی دارد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('8b7220d7-1338-5785-b523-cfd6f9aa1e0c','2b364b97-a8a7-5d03-a94a-fef85622304f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if you are required to do or have something, a law or rule says you must do it or have it',null,null,'اگر از شما خواسته می شود کاری را انجام دهید یا داشته باشید، یک قانون یا قانون می گوید که باید آن را انجام دهید یا آن را داشته باشید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You are required by law to wear a seat belt.","translation":"طبق قانون شما ملزم به بستن کمربند ایمنی هستید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000777846.mp3"},{"sentence":"Regulations require that students attend at least 90% of the lectures.","translation":"مقررات ایجاب می کند که دانشجویان حداقل در 90 درصد از سخنرانی ها شرکت کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000777849.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bill failed to get the required number of votes.","translation":"این لایحه نتوانست آرای لازم را کسب کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000777852.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
