('b7cc649e-0e1f-56f7-9eef-868a57276b17','99582328-88b1-59c0-abdd-f39a0153416b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a set of movements , jokes etc that form part of a performance','[ countable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از حرکات، شوخی ها و غیره که بخشی از یک اجرا را تشکیل می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s daily routine Make exercise part of your daily routine.','somebody’s normal/usual/regular routine Although he''d gone, I continued with my normal routine.','somebody’s morning routine His morning routine started with a cup of tea followed by a shower.','the old routine I get sick of the same old routine day after day.','a familiar routine Cats and dogs like a familiar routine.','get (somebody) into a routine (= develop a fixed order of doing things, or make someone do this ) Try to get your baby into a routine.','slip/fall/settle into a routine (= get into a routine without making any difficulty ) The team slipped quickly into a routine.','break a routine (= do something different ) Bella didn’t break her routine for anyone.','disrupt/upset somebody’s routine She disliked things that disrupted her routine.','a matter of routine This briefing is a matter of routine whenever a new minister takes office.','a break from routine (= a change ) I needed a break from routine.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a dance routine","translation":"یک روال رقص","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001633037.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3c569d3a-f6b2-58bb-9a41-584b22d318ef','99582328-88b1-59c0-abdd-f39a0153416b',3,null,null,'technical','a set of instructions given to a computer so that it will do a particular operation','[ countable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از دستورالعمل هایی که به کامپیوتر داده می شود تا عملیات خاصی را انجام دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s daily routine Make exercise part of your daily routine.','somebody’s normal/usual/regular routine Although he''d gone, I continued with my normal routine.','somebody’s morning routine His morning routine started with a cup of tea followed by a shower.','the old routine I get sick of the same old routine day after day.','a familiar routine Cats and dogs like a familiar routine.','get (somebody) into a routine (= develop a fixed order of doing things, or make someone do this ) Try to get your baby into a routine.','slip/fall/settle into a routine (= get into a routine without making any difficulty ) The team slipped quickly into a routine.','break a routine (= do something different ) Bella didn’t break her routine for anyone.','disrupt/upset somebody’s routine She disliked things that disrupted her routine.','a matter of routine This briefing is a matter of routine whenever a new minister takes office.','a break from routine (= a change ) I needed a break from routine.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('375290b9-cd18-5753-a37d-b2c9b37bba0d','4f65e7ab-37b3-596a-9128-6504ea8c7a2d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','happening as a normal part of a job or process',null,null,'به عنوان بخشی عادی از یک کار یا فرآیند اتفاق می افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['routine maintenance The system will be shut down overnight for routine maintenance.','routine work We need more junior staff to help out with the routine work.','a routine operation/procedure (= medical operation ) Many routine operations had to be cancelled.','a routine check Police stopped the vehicle for a routine check.','routine monitoring/screening/inspection the routine screening of milk for contamination']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You mustn’t worry. These are just routine enquiries.","translation":"شما نباید نگران باشید اینها فقط پرس و جوهای معمولی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001633040.mp3"},{"sentence":"routine maintenance work","translation":"کار تعمیر و نگهداری معمول","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001633041.mp3"},{"sentence":"a routine operation","translation":"یک عملیات معمولی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001633042.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5e42c59a-7514-5a58-8216-8e00009edec7','4f65e7ab-37b3-596a-9128-6504ea8c7a2d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','ordinary and boring',null,null,'معمولی و خسته کننده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['routine maintenance The system will be shut down overnight for routine maintenance.','routine work We need more junior staff to help out with the routine work.','a routine operation/procedure (= medical operation ) Many routine operations had to be cancelled.','a routine check Police stopped the vehicle for a routine check.','routine monitoring/screening/inspection the routine screening of milk for contamination']::text[],'[{"sentence":"routine tasks such as washing up","translation":"کارهای معمولی مانند شستن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000732328.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1cc1851e-c5f8-5f06-bd8a-420235aea85d','242c991a-6a8c-5d01-ba36-ae3486a0c821',1,null,null,'spoken & written','food, paper etc that is no longer needed and has been thrown away',null,null,'زباله، آشغال؛ چرت و پرت (حرف)؛ زباله (بدرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a rubbish bin","translation":"یک سطل زباله","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001633252.mp3"},{"sentence":"household rubbish","translation":"زباله های خانگی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001633255.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b7cbc493-e9f3-5096-a45a-f58a6e3d8c07','242c991a-6a8c-5d01-ba36-ae3486a0c821',2,null,null,'informal','objects , papers etc that you no longer use and should throw away',null,null,'اشیاء، کاغذها و غیره که دیگر استفاده نمی کنید و باید دور بریزید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve got so much rubbish on my desk it’s unbelievable.","translation":"من آنقدر آشغال روی میزم دارم که باور نکردنی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000733134.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2178718d-8c48-50f8-9525-4236b71d3ef0','242c991a-6a8c-5d01-ba36-ae3486a0c821',3,null,null,'informal','an idea, statement etc that is rubbish is silly or wrong and does not deserve serious attention',null,null,'یک ایده، بیانیه و غیره که پوچ است، احمقانه یا اشتباه است و سزاوار توجه جدی نیست',array['nonsense']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You do talk rubbish sometimes.","translation":"شما گاهی اوقات مزخرف حرف میزنید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000733140.mp3"},{"sentence":"That’s a load of rubbish .","translation":"این یک بار زباله است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000733143.mp3"},{"sentence":"The suggestion is absolute rubbish .","translation":"پیشنهاد مزخرف مطلق است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001633266.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('64bbd9d5-0a0e-51b2-b77c-30995133219b','242c991a-6a8c-5d01-ba36-ae3486a0c821',4,null,null,'informal','a film , book etc that is rubbish is very bad',null,null,'یک فیلم، کتاب و غیره که زباله است بسیار بد است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the usual Hollywood rubbish","translation":"آشغال های معمول هالیوود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000733153.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
