('2efee8f7-c9fe-5721-b95a-a2d51dc9144e','4e7bcb1a-23eb-5472-8622-de6efa09ad6e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when you achieve what you want or intend',null,null,'موفقیت، پیروزی؛ موفقیت (فرد)؛ موفقیت (محدود)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a great success Everyone agreed the picnic was a great success.','a big/huge/major success The government claimed the policy was a major success.','a resounding/outstanding/spectacular success (= very great success ) Financially, the event was a resounding success.','great/considerable success This plant can be grown by the absolute beginner with great success.','some success The group is already achieving some success.','little/no success Attempts to resolve the dispute met with little success.','limited success (= not very much success ) The attempt to replace coca with other crops has had only limited success.','commercial/economic/financial success None of his ideas had any commercial success.','academic success (= success in education ) There is no evidence that early teaching of reading leads to academic success.','electoral success (= success in elections ) The electoral success of the far right understandably fills many people in Europe with alarm.','military success This military success was achieved at a cost.','have/achieve success China has had considerable success in conserving water since 1983.','meet with success (= be successful ) We are disappointed that this round of negotiations has not met with success.','put your success down to something (= say that your success was the result of it ) They put their success down to their excellent teamwork.','somebody’s chance of success They have a good chance of success.','the secret of somebody’s success (= what makes them successful ) A visitor asked Connie the secret of her success with growing roses.','the success rate (= what percentage of actions are successful ) The success rate in cloning is still extremely low.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The experiment was a big success.","translation":"آزمایش موفقیت بزرگی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743178.mp3"},{"sentence":"I tried to contact him, but without success.","translation":"سعی کردم با او تماس بگیرم اما موفق نشدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743179.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you have any success in persuading Alan to come?","translation":"آیا موفقیتی در متقاعد کردن آلن برای آمدن داشتید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743204.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6e637411-1ba3-5869-abab-272912d7feda','4e7bcb1a-23eb-5472-8622-de6efa09ad6e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','when a lot of people like something, buy something, go to see something etc',null,null,'وقتی افراد زیادی چیزی را دوست دارند، چیزی می خرند، به دیدن چیزی می روند و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a great success Everyone agreed the picnic was a great success.','a big/huge/major success The government claimed the policy was a major success.','a resounding/outstanding/spectacular success (= very great success ) Financially, the event was a resounding success.','great/considerable success This plant can be grown by the absolute beginner with great success.','some success The group is already achieving some success.','little/no success Attempts to resolve the dispute met with little success.','limited success (= not very much success ) The attempt to replace coca with other crops has had only limited success.','commercial/economic/financial success None of his ideas had any commercial success.','academic success (= success in education ) There is no evidence that early teaching of reading leads to academic success.','electoral success (= success in elections ) The electoral success of the far right understandably fills many people in Europe with alarm.','military success This military success was achieved at a cost.','have/achieve success China has had considerable success in conserving water since 1983.','meet with success (= be successful ) We are disappointed that this round of negotiations has not met with success.','put your success down to something (= say that your success was the result of it ) They put their success down to their excellent teamwork.','somebody’s chance of success They have a good chance of success.','the secret of somebody’s success (= what makes them successful ) A visitor asked Connie the secret of her success with growing roses.','the success rate (= what percentage of actions are successful ) The success rate in cloning is still extremely low.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The film was a great success.","translation":"این فیلم یک موفقیت بزرگ بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743209.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her book has enjoyed a lot of success (= it has been very successful ) .","translation":"کتاب او بسیار موفق بوده است (= بسیار موفق بوده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743210.mp3"},{"sentence":"The play was a box-office success (= many people went to see it ) .","translation":"این نمایشنامه در گیشه موفق بود (= افراد زیادی برای دیدن آن رفتند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743215.mp3"},{"sentence":"The show was an overnight success (= it was immediately successful ) .","translation":"نمایش یک شبه موفقیت آمیز بود (= بلافاصله موفق شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743220.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('b5188791-c892-5246-97cd-557d8c2359d5','4e7bcb1a-23eb-5472-8622-de6efa09ad6e',3,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone achieves a high position in their job , on a course , in a sport , in society etc',null,null,'زمانی که فردی در شغل خود، در یک دوره آموزشی، در یک ورزش، در جامعه و غیره به موقعیت بالایی دست یابد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a great success Everyone agreed the picnic was a great success.','a big/huge/major success The government claimed the policy was a major success.','a resounding/outstanding/spectacular success (= very great success ) Financially, the event was a resounding success.','great/considerable success This plant can be grown by the absolute beginner with great success.','some success The group is already achieving some success.','little/no success Attempts to resolve the dispute met with little success.','limited success (= not very much success ) The attempt to replace coca with other crops has had only limited success.','commercial/economic/financial success None of his ideas had any commercial success.','academic success (= success in education ) There is no evidence that early teaching of reading leads to academic success.','electoral success (= success in elections ) The electoral success of the far right understandably fills many people in Europe with alarm.','military success This military success was achieved at a cost.','have/achieve success China has had considerable success in conserving water since 1983.','meet with success (= be successful ) We are disappointed that this round of negotiations has not met with success.','put your success down to something (= say that your success was the result of it ) They put their success down to their excellent teamwork.','somebody’s chance of success They have a good chance of success.','the secret of somebody’s success (= what makes them successful ) A visitor asked Connie the secret of her success with growing roses.','the success rate (= what percentage of actions are successful ) The success rate in cloning is still extremely low.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Success isn’t everything, you know.","translation":"موفقیت همه چیز نیست، می دانید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743227.mp3"},{"sentence":"He has already had a lot of success in his career.","translation":"او قبلاً موفقیت های زیادی در حرفه خود داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743230.mp3"},{"sentence":"She wasn’t much of a success as a lawyer.","translation":"او به عنوان یک وکیل چندان موفق نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743234.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s determined to make a success of (= be successful in ) her career.","translation":"او مصمم است که در حرفه خود موفق شود (= موفق شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743235.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('c1f9cee4-ad3b-53fa-ae9a-3057b10f8bfe','4e7bcb1a-23eb-5472-8622-de6efa09ad6e',4,null,null,'spoken & written','when a business makes a lot of money',null,null,'زمانی که یک کسب و کار پول زیادی به دست می آورد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a great success Everyone agreed the picnic was a great success.','a big/huge/major success The government claimed the policy was a major success.','a resounding/outstanding/spectacular success (= very great success ) Financially, the event was a resounding success.','great/considerable success This plant can be grown by the absolute beginner with great success.','some success The group is already achieving some success.','little/no success Attempts to resolve the dispute met with little success.','limited success (= not very much success ) The attempt to replace coca with other crops has had only limited success.','commercial/economic/financial success None of his ideas had any commercial success.','academic success (= success in education ) There is no evidence that early teaching of reading leads to academic success.','electoral success (= success in elections ) The electoral success of the far right understandably fills many people in Europe with alarm.','military success This military success was achieved at a cost.','have/achieve success China has had considerable success in conserving water since 1983.','meet with success (= be successful ) We are disappointed that this round of negotiations has not met with success.','put your success down to something (= say that your success was the result of it ) They put their success down to their excellent teamwork.','somebody’s chance of success They have a good chance of success.','the secret of somebody’s success (= what makes them successful ) A visitor asked Connie the secret of her success with growing roses.','the success rate (= what percentage of actions are successful ) The success rate in cloning is still extremely low.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the success of his latest business venture","translation":"موفقیت آخرین سرمایه گذاری تجاری او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743242.mp3"},{"sentence":"The firm wasn’t a great success.","translation":"این شرکت موفقیت بزرگی نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743245.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d6a63e7b-5363-5eb2-b9ff-d763f787cffe','4e7bcb1a-23eb-5472-8622-de6efa09ad6e',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'success story','موفقیت، پیروزی؛ موفقیت (فرد)؛ موفقیت (محدود)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a great success Everyone agreed the picnic was a great success.','a big/huge/major success The government claimed the policy was a major success.','a resounding/outstanding/spectacular success (= very great success ) Financially, the event was a resounding success.','great/considerable success This plant can be grown by the absolute beginner with great success.','some success The group is already achieving some success.','little/no success Attempts to resolve the dispute met with little success.','limited success (= not very much success ) The attempt to replace coca with other crops has had only limited success.','commercial/economic/financial success None of his ideas had any commercial success.','academic success (= success in education ) There is no evidence that early teaching of reading leads to academic success.','electoral success (= success in elections ) The electoral success of the far right understandably fills many people in Europe with alarm.','military success This military success was achieved at a cost.','have/achieve success China has had considerable success in conserving water since 1983.','meet with success (= be successful ) We are disappointed that this round of negotiations has not met with success.','put your success down to something (= say that your success was the result of it ) They put their success down to their excellent teamwork.','somebody’s chance of success They have a good chance of success.','the secret of somebody’s success (= what makes them successful ) A visitor asked Connie the secret of her success with growing roses.','the success rate (= what percentage of actions are successful ) The success rate in cloning is still extremely low.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b4a70e6c-3631-568c-bfb1-0a372d21e7e8','4a652ea5-7eef-58de-b657-6bc51d939b0b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to tell someone your ideas about what they should do, where they should go etc',null,null,'پیشنهاد کردن، پیشنهاد دادن (ایده)؛ در میان گذاشتن (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The zoo asked its visitors to suggest a name for the new baby panda.","translation":"باغ وحش از بازدیدکنندگانش خواست تا نامی برای بچه پاندای جدید پیشنهاد کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001541.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her mother suggested that she should go and see the doctor.","translation":"مادرش به او پیشنهاد کرد که برود و به دکتر مراجعه کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001542.mp3"},{"sentence":"I suggest you call him first.","translation":"پیشنهاد میکنم اول بهش زنگ بزنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001543.mp3"},{"sentence":"It has been suggested that the manager will resign if any more players are sold.","translation":"گفته می شود در صورت فروش بازیکنان دیگر، سرمربی تیم استعفا خواهد داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621239.mp3"},{"sentence":"Johnson suggested to Boswell that they should buy the island.","translation":"جانسون به بوسول پیشنهاد کرد که جزیره را بخرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00859.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tracey suggested meeting for a drink after work.","translation":"تریسی پیشنهاد داد بعد از کار برای نوشیدن یک نوشیدنی ملاقات کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001544.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you suggest what kind of tool I should use?","translation":"میشه راهنمایی کنید از چه ابزاری استفاده کنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001545.mp3"},{"sentence":"May I suggest that you think carefully before rushing into this?","translation":"آیا می توانم پیشنهاد کنم قبل از عجله در این مورد به دقت فکر کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000631010.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('43054fb8-9482-581f-b993-3c396999047e','4a652ea5-7eef-58de-b657-6bc51d939b0b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to make someone think that a particular thing is true',null,null,'وادار کردن کسی فکر کند که یک چیز خاص درست است',array['indicate']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Trends in spending and investment suggest a gradual economic recovery.","translation":"روند در هزینه ها و سرمایه گذاری حاکی از بهبود تدریجی اقتصادی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621252.mp3"},{"sentence":"Opinion polls suggest that only 10% of the population trust the government.","translation":"نظرسنجی ها نشان می دهد که تنها 10 درصد از مردم به دولت اعتماد دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020270.mp3"},{"sentence":"The evidence suggests that single fathers are more likely to work than single mothers.","translation":"شواهد نشان می دهد که پدران مجرد بیشتر از مادران مجرد کار می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621255.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4d3b8aea-ac61-54a9-8cc7-0908183f0e89','4a652ea5-7eef-58de-b657-6bc51d939b0b',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to tell someone about someone or something that is suitable for a particular job or activity',null,null,'گفتن به کسی در مورد کسی یا چیزی که برای یک کار یا فعالیت خاص مناسب است',array['recommend']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"John Roberts has been suggested for the post of manager.","translation":"جان رابرتز برای پست سرمربی پیشنهاد شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000631024.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('07f591a1-7aa9-5e3b-959d-766912da1775','4a652ea5-7eef-58de-b657-6bc51d939b0b',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to state something in an indirect way',null,null,'بیان چیزی به صورت غیر مستقیم',array['imply']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Are you suggesting my husband’s been drinking?","translation":"آیا شما به شوهرم پیشنهاد می کنید که مشروب بخورد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621263.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6b134fd7-a5c4-51a3-bfe9-3469713363d6','4a652ea5-7eef-58de-b657-6bc51d939b0b',5,null,null,'spoken & written','to remind someone of something or help them to imagine it',null,null,'چیزی را به کسی یادآوری کند یا به او کمک کند آن را تصور کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The stage was bare, with only the lighting to suggest a prison.","translation":"صحنه برهنه بود و فقط نورپردازی حکایت از زندان داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000631051.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e9af923d-999a-5418-b0ad-f6f221f06399','4a652ea5-7eef-58de-b657-6bc51d939b0b',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'something suggests itself','پیشنهاد کردن، پیشنهاد دادن (ایده)؛ در میان گذاشتن (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e1874567-ec70-508c-ae91-10da3cfa2282','4a652ea5-7eef-58de-b657-6bc51d939b0b',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'I’m not suggesting','پیشنهاد کردن، پیشنهاد دادن (ایده)؛ در میان گذاشتن (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('cbd77a50-7571-51ca-9674-24a3c6025e13','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',1,'agree and help','موافقت کنید و کمک کنید','spoken & written','to say that you agree with an idea, group, or person, and usually to help them because you want them to succeed',null,null,'پشتیبانی کردن، حمایت کردن (از)؛ تامین کردن (خانواده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The bill was supported by a large majority in the Senate.","translation":"این لایحه با اکثریت زیادی در سنا مورد حمایت قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600725.mp3"},{"sentence":"We need to support our teachers in their efforts to raise standards.","translation":"ما باید از معلمان خود در تلاش برای ارتقای استانداردها حمایت کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020272.mp3"},{"sentence":"We strongly support the peace process.","translation":"ما قویا از روند صلح حمایت می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612298.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2711a9c4-58aa-55ea-9dc7-4266e3491e9b','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',2,'be kind to somebody','با کسی مهربان باش','spoken & written','to help someone by being sympathetic and kind to them during a difficult time in their life',null,null,'برای کمک به کسی با همدردی و مهربانی با او در دوران سخت زندگی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"My wife supported me enormously.","translation":"همسرم به شدت از من حمایت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600753.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('dffebb0f-6e13-5727-a19f-a2f45679aafd','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',3,'provide money to live','پول برای زندگی فراهم کند','spoken & written','to provide enough money for someone to pay for all the things they need',null,null,'فراهم کردن پول کافی برای کسی که بتواند تمام چیزهایی را که نیاز دارد بپردازد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I have a wife and two children to support .","translation":"من یک زن و دو فرزند برای حمایت دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612302.mp3"},{"sentence":"She supports her family by teaching evening classes.","translation":"او با تدریس کلاس های عصرانه از خانواده خود حمایت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612310.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have no idea how I am going to support myself.","translation":"من نمی دانم چگونه می خواهم از خودم حمایت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600743.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('837563c5-2785-5f8f-b601-8286adf55982','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',4,'give money to something','پول دادن به چیزی','spoken & written','to give money to a group, organization, or event etc to encourage it or pay for its costs',null,null,'دادن پول به یک گروه، سازمان، یا رویداد و غیره برای تشویق آن یا پرداخت هزینه های آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are a handful of charities which I support regularly.","translation":"تعداد انگشت شماری خیریه وجود دارد که من به طور مرتب از آنها حمایت می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612313.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2f4419f0-86e6-53e0-b882-fb32fdd9e2c5','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',5,'hold something up','چیزی را نگه دارید','spoken & written','to hold the weight of something, keep it in place, or prevent it from falling',null,null,'برای نگه داشتن وزن چیزی، نگه داشتن آن در جای خود یا جلوگیری از افتادن آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The middle part of the bridge is supported by two huge towers.","translation":"قسمت میانی پل را دو برج عظیم نگه می دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600736.mp3"},{"sentence":"During sleep, our spine no longer needs to support the weight of our body.","translation":"در طول خواب، ستون فقرات ما دیگر نیازی به تحمل وزن بدن ما ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612314.mp3"},{"sentence":"I got to my feet, supporting myself on the side of the table.","translation":"روی پاهایم بلند شدم و خودم را کنار میز نگه داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612322.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7df134e2-543b-5294-9562-df316dcc8929','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',6,'prove something','چیزی را ثابت کند','spoken & written','if results, facts, studies etc support an idea or statement, they show or prove that it is correct',null,null,'اگر نتایج، حقایق، مطالعات و غیره از یک ایده یا گزاره حمایت کنند، درستی آن را نشان می دهند یا ثابت می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The results support our original theory.","translation":"نتایج از نظریه اصلی ما پشتیبانی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600768.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is little evidence to support such explanations.","translation":"شواهد کمی برای حمایت از چنین توضیحاتی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612323.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('39c5b0cf-6160-505a-b3bc-3f94fe37e940','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',7,'sports team','تیم ورزشی','spoken & written','to like a particular sports team and go to watch the games they play',null,null,'یک تیم ورزشی خاص را دوست داشته باشند و به تماشای بازی هایی که انجام می دهند بروند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Which team do you support ?","translation":"طرفدار کدام تیم هستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612324.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve supported Liverpool all my life.","translation":"من تمام عمرم از لیورپول حمایت کرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600775.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('51689384-365c-5a3d-8a01-40dbb24411f3','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',8,'computers','کامپیوترها','spoken & written','to provide information and material to improve a computer program or system, or to make it keep working',null,null,'برای ارائه اطلاعات و مطالب برای بهبود یک برنامه یا سیستم کامپیوتری یا ادامه کار آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I don’t think they support that version of the program anymore.","translation":"من فکر نمی کنم آنها دیگر از آن نسخه از برنامه پشتیبانی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612336.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('54b22ffe-dec7-5052-a94c-53f00b36ead4','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',9,'land','زمین','spoken & written','if land can support people or animals, it is of good enough quality to grow enough food for them to live',null,null,'اگر زمین بتواند از مردم یا حیوانات حمایت کند، کیفیت آن به اندازه کافی خوب است تا غذای کافی برای زندگی آنها تولید شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"This land can’t support many cattle.","translation":"این زمین نمی تواند دام های زیادی را تحمل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600758.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e3d03be5-abd4-5e6a-b8e3-10ad373b1f19','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',10,'water/air/earth','آب / هوا / زمین','spoken & written','if water, air, or earth can support life, it is clean enough, has enough oxygen etc to keep animals or plants alive',null,null,'اگر آب، هوا یا زمین بتواند حیات را پشتیبانی کند، به اندازه کافی تمیز است، اکسیژن کافی دارد و غیره برای زنده نگه داشتن حیوانات یا گیاهان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Because of pollution, this lake is now too acid to support fish.","translation":"به دلیل آلودگی، این دریاچه در حال حاضر بیش از حد اسیدی است که نمی تواند ماهی ها را پشتیبانی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612343.mp3"},{"sentence":"healthy soil that can support plant life","translation":"خاک سالمی که می تواند از زندگی گیاهان حمایت کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612344.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('30e7985f-e888-541f-b519-2daedcdb4d19','8b73ec92-53c1-5f5e-8fdf-3a818e1ca97b',11,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'support a habit','پشتیبانی کردن، حمایت کردن (از)؛ تامین کردن (خانواده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f907eeee-db48-5a3e-be02-abca5509794a','9ec63baa-bba3-575a-83f9-9084b8036c62',1,'approval','تایید','spoken & written','approval , encouragement , and perhaps help for a person, idea, plan etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'پشتیبانی، حمایت؛ پشتیبانی (پرداخت)؛ حمایت (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have support The extreme right-wing parties don’t have much popular support.','give (your) support ( also lend (your) support formal ) The American people gave him their enthusiastic support. The naturalist Sir David Attenborough has lent his support to the campaign.','pledge/offer (your) support (= say that you will support someone or something ) Both the opposition parties pledged full support for the new administration.','get/draw support The plan drew wide support from parents.','win/gain/attract support Try to win the support of local shopkeepers.','enjoy/command support formal (= have support ) His views were too extreme to command general support.','drum up/rally support (= get people’s support by making an effort ) Both sides have been drumming up support through the internet.','enlist somebody’s support formal (= ask for and get their support ) He wrote to the prime minister in an attempt to enlist his support.','mobilize support (= get people to support something in an active way ) Part of their mission was to mobilize popular support for Franco.','build (up) support (= increase it ) Now he needs to build his support by explaining what he believes in.','withdraw support (= no longer support ) He''s decided to withdraw his support for the project.','public/popular support There seemed to be no popular support for war.','widespread/wide/general support There is widespread support for the Government’s proposal.','strong support A survey found strong support for the project among hospital staff.','massive support We have massive public support.','somebody’s full support That view deserves the full support of all farmers.','whole-hearted/enthusiastic support I want you to know that you have my whole-hearted support.','active support (= approval and help ) Les, with the active support of his wife Pam, has spent several years compiling a list of the prisoners.','unanimous support (= when all members of a group support something ) There was nearly unanimous support for the proposal.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Local people have given us a lot of support in our campaign.","translation":"مردم محلی در کمپین ما از ما حمایت زیادی کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600801.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was widespread support for the war.","translation":"حمایت گسترده ای از جنگ وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001820789.mp3"},{"sentence":"They signed a petition in support of the pay claim.","translation":"آنها طوماری را در حمایت از ادعای حقوق امضا کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600804.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had the full support of the general committee.","translation":"او از حمایت کامل کمیته عمومی برخوردار بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612363.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('94b7a7df-3265-5ef1-8d05-985a32d8156e','9ec63baa-bba3-575a-83f9-9084b8036c62',2,'sympathy/help','همدردی/کمک','spoken & written','sympathy and help that you give to someone who is in a difficult situation or who is very unhappy','[ uncountable ]',null,'همدردی و کمکی که به کسی می کنید که در شرایط سختی است یا بسیار ناراضی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have support The extreme right-wing parties don’t have much popular support.','give (your) support ( also lend (your) support formal ) The American people gave him their enthusiastic support. The naturalist Sir David Attenborough has lent his support to the campaign.','pledge/offer (your) support (= say that you will support someone or something ) Both the opposition parties pledged full support for the new administration.','get/draw support The plan drew wide support from parents.','win/gain/attract support Try to win the support of local shopkeepers.','enjoy/command support formal (= have support ) His views were too extreme to command general support.','drum up/rally support (= get people’s support by making an effort ) Both sides have been drumming up support through the internet.','enlist somebody’s support formal (= ask for and get their support ) He wrote to the prime minister in an attempt to enlist his support.','mobilize support (= get people to support something in an active way ) Part of their mission was to mobilize popular support for Franco.','build (up) support (= increase it ) Now he needs to build his support by explaining what he believes in.','withdraw support (= no longer support ) He''s decided to withdraw his support for the project.','public/popular support There seemed to be no popular support for war.','widespread/wide/general support There is widespread support for the Government’s proposal.','strong support A survey found strong support for the project among hospital staff.','massive support We have massive public support.','somebody’s full support That view deserves the full support of all farmers.','whole-hearted/enthusiastic support I want you to know that you have my whole-hearted support.','active support (= approval and help ) Les, with the active support of his wife Pam, has spent several years compiling a list of the prisoners.','unanimous support (= when all members of a group support something ) There was nearly unanimous support for the proposal.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I couldn’t have made it through those times without the support of my boyfriend Rob.","translation":"من بدون حمایت دوست پسرم راب نمی توانستم آن دوران را پشت سر بگذارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612375.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
