hearted/enthusiastic support I want you to know that you have my whole-hearted support.','active support (= approval and help ) Les, with the active support of his wife Pam, has spent several years compiling a list of the prisoners.','unanimous support (= when all members of a group support something ) There was nearly unanimous support for the proposal.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The European Union is considering whether to provide financial support for the expedition.","translation":"اتحادیه اروپا در حال بررسی این موضوع است که آیا از این اکسپدیشن حمایت مالی می کند یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612383.mp3"},{"sentence":"With your support, we can help these youngsters.","translation":"با حمایت شما می توانیم به این جوانان کمک کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612387.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
