rt of all farmers.','whole-hearted/enthusiastic support I want you to know that you have my whole-hearted support.','active support (= approval and help ) Les, with the active support of his wife Pam, has spent several years compiling a list of the prisoners.','unanimous support (= when all members of a group support something ) There was nearly unanimous support for the proposal.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The roof may need extra support.","translation":"سقف ممکن است نیاز به پشتیبانی اضافی داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600828.mp3"},{"sentence":"the wooden supports of the bridge","translation":"تکیه گاه های چوبی پل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612390.mp3"},{"sentence":"She grabbed at his shoulders for support.","translation":"برای حمایت شانه های او را گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612391.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
