hat view deserves the full support of all farmers.','whole-hearted/enthusiastic support I want you to know that you have my whole-hearted support.','active support (= approval and help ) Les, with the active support of his wife Pam, has spent several years compiling a list of the prisoners.','unanimous support (= when all members of a group support something ) There was nearly unanimous support for the proposal.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"our technical support team","translation":"تیم پشتیبانی فنی ما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612402.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
