dy’s full support That view deserves the full support of all farmers.','whole-hearted/enthusiastic support I want you to know that you have my whole-hearted support.','active support (= approval and help ) Les, with the active support of his wife Pam, has spent several years compiling a list of the prisoners.','unanimous support (= when all members of a group support something ) There was nearly unanimous support for the proposal.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We played support to a band called Shallow.","translation":"ما برای گروهی به نام Shallow ساپورت می‌کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612413.mp3"},{"sentence":"the support band","translation":"باند پشتیبانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612417.mp3"},{"sentence":"the support act (= the support band )","translation":"عمل پشتیبانی (= باند پشتیبانی)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612420.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
