('ca12524f-646e-571a-9c2e-bcdc10cb147b','8e204511-a0fc-5907-9c6f-1d277eb139ef',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a regular period each day when people can see a doctor or dentist','[ uncountable ]',null,'یک دوره منظم هر روز که افراد می توانند به پزشک یا دندانپزشک مراجعه کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have surgery Leslie had surgery on her toe last year.','undergo surgery formal (= have surgery ) He underwent surgery to remove a bullet from his chest. There are risks if you choose to undergo surgery.','do/carry out surgery ( also perform surgery formal ) A San Antonio doctor has volunteered to perform the surgery at no cost.','need surgery ( also require surgery formal ) He is likely to need surgery in the near future.','successful The surgery was successful and he’s recovering well.','major/minor surgery He will require major surgery to remove the lump. The president will undergo minor surgery today to remove a small growth from his finger.','heart/knee/brain etc surgery She is now fit again after knee surgery.','emergency surgery (= done quickly, in an emergency ) The teenager underwent emergency surgery after a bullet pierced her lung.','cosmetic/plastic surgery (= surgery to improve someone’s appearance ) More and more people are choosing to have plastic surgery.','laser surgery (= surgery done using a laser ) The doctor suggested laser surgery to improve her sight.','keyhole surgery (= surgery done through a very small hole in the skin ) The operation will be done using keyhole surgery.','elective surgery formal (= surgery that is not necessary, but you choose to have ) There are often long waiting times for elective surgery.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Surgery is from 9 am to 1 pm on weekdays.","translation":"عمل جراحی در روزهای کاری از ساعت 9 صبح تا 1 بعد از ظهر انجام می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020273.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2562e8e5-3af0-5ca8-bf00-cea8288d1494','8e204511-a0fc-5907-9c6f-1d277eb139ef',5,null,null,'spoken & written','a special period of time when people can see a Member of Parliament to discuss problems','[ countable ]',null,'یک دوره زمانی خاص که مردم می توانند یک نماینده مجلس را برای بحث در مورد مشکلات ببینند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have surgery Leslie had surgery on her toe last year.','undergo surgery formal (= have surgery ) He underwent surgery to remove a bullet from his chest. There are risks if you choose to undergo surgery.','do/carry out surgery ( also perform surgery formal ) A San Antonio doctor has volunteered to perform the surgery at no cost.','need surgery ( also require surgery formal ) He is likely to need surgery in the near future.','successful The surgery was successful and he’s recovering well.','major/minor surgery He will require major surgery to remove the lump. The president will undergo minor surgery today to remove a small growth from his finger.','heart/knee/brain etc surgery She is now fit again after knee surgery.','emergency surgery (= done quickly, in an emergency ) The teenager underwent emergency surgery after a bullet pierced her lung.','cosmetic/plastic surgery (= surgery to improve someone’s appearance ) More and more people are choosing to have plastic surgery.','laser surgery (= surgery done using a laser ) The doctor suggested laser surgery to improve her sight.','keyhole surgery (= surgery done through a very small hole in the skin ) The operation will be done using keyhole surgery.','elective surgery formal (= surgery that is not necessary, but you choose to have ) There are often long waiting times for elective surgery.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('08bec20b-ee94-597d-b445-10fa04a0ae39','40494793-181b-577d-a5a3-826763767def',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to continue to live after an accident , war , or illness','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'جان به در بردن؛ بقا داشتن (فرد)؛ دوام آوردن (شرکت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Only 12 of the 140 passengers survived.","translation":"از 140 مسافر تنها 12 نفر زنده ماندند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602808.mp3"},{"sentence":"She survived the attack.","translation":"او از این حمله جان سالم به در برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577163.mp3"},{"sentence":"people who survive cancer","translation":"افرادی که از سرطان جان سالم به در می برند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577164.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('38fc69af-43f8-5259-9ca4-a47060b0b3a2','40494793-181b-577d-a5a3-826763767def',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to continue to live normally in spite of many problems','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'با وجود مشکلات فراوان به زندگی عادی خود ادامه دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m sure she will survive this crisis.","translation":"من مطمئن هستم که او از این بحران جان سالم به در خواهد برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577165.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve had a tough few months, but I’ll survive.","translation":"من چند ماه سختی را پشت سر گذاشتم، اما زنده خواهم ماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577166.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a652fbc6-7ce4-5cf5-97c3-c94cae4021d7','40494793-181b-577d-a5a3-826763767def',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to manage to live a normal life even though you have very little money','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای داشتن یک زندگی عادی با وجود اینکه پول بسیار کمی دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I don’t know how you all manage to survive on Jeremy’s salary.","translation":"من نمی دانم چگونه همه شما توانستید با حقوق جرمی زنده بمانید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602828.mp3"},{"sentence":"the amount that a family needs each week just to survive","translation":"مقداری که یک خانواده در هفته فقط برای زنده ماندن به آن نیاز دارد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577170.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1c3ab079-106e-5c2d-8517-1d14d9ac2414','40494793-181b-577d-a5a3-826763767def',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to continue to exist after a long time','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای ادامه حیات پس از مدتی طولانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A few pages of the original manuscript still survive.","translation":"چند صفحه از نسخه اصلی هنوز باقی مانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602816.mp3"},{"sentence":"Several buildings in the town have survived from medieval times.","translation":"چندین ساختمان در این شهر از قرون وسطی باقی مانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577173.mp3"},{"sentence":"an old custom which has survived into the twenty-first century","translation":"یک رسم قدیمی که تا قرن بیست و یکم باقی مانده است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577176.mp3"},{"sentence":"The main building was demolished, but the library still survives as a museum.","translation":"ساختمان اصلی تخریب شد، اما کتابخانه هنوز به عنوان موزه باقی مانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577179.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('06ea1548-f2a8-5422-8383-565518e3969f','40494793-181b-577d-a5a3-826763767def',5,null,null,'spoken & written','to continue to be successful','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'برای ادامه موفقیت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The car industry cannot survive without government help.","translation":"صنعت خودرو بدون کمک دولت نمی تواند دوام بیاورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577183.mp3"},{"sentence":"A lot of smaller firms did not survive the recession.","translation":"بسیاری از شرکت های کوچکتر از رکود جان سالم به در نبردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577184.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('21cb7035-53da-56e9-8906-853884bb67d1','40494793-181b-577d-a5a3-826763767def',6,null,null,'spoken & written','to live longer than someone else, usually someone closely related to you','[ transitive ]',null,'طولانی تر از دیگران زندگی کنید، معمولاً کسی که از نزدیک با شما مرتبط است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He is survived by his wife Sue.","translation":"از او همسرش سو به یادگار مانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602833.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('eaeaf4b5-7c6a-5e58-ba6d-c2af2c28551e','754d99f6-57c4-54e2-bfe9-f17ca6e26cb7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that something is probably true , especially something bad',null,null,'گمان کردن، مشکوک بودن (به)؛ ظن داشتن (بر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I suspected that there was something wrong with the engine.","translation":"من مشکوک بودم که مشکلی در موتور وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577218.mp3"},{"sentence":"She strongly suspected he was lying to her.","translation":"او به شدت مشکوک بود که او به او دروغ می گوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602922.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s not going to be very happy about this, I suspect .","translation":"من گمان می کنم که او از این موضوع خیلی خوشحال نخواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577222.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4d69db11-952e-5e85-b54c-39d56269f016','754d99f6-57c4-54e2-bfe9-f17ca6e26cb7',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that something bad has happened or is happening',null,null,'فکر کردن به اینکه اتفاق بدی افتاده یا در حال رخ دادن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The doctors suspected pneumonia.","translation":"پزشکان به ذات الریه مشکوک بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577228.mp3"},{"sentence":"The position of the body led the police to suspect murder.","translation":"موقعیت جسد پلیس را به قتل سوق داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577231.mp3"},{"sentence":"He never suspected anything.","translation":"او هرگز به چیزی مشکوک نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577234.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('754ac6e2-2ce5-5395-9871-5878f19efa63','754d99f6-57c4-54e2-bfe9-f17ca6e26cb7',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that someone is probably guilty of a crime',null,null,'فکر کردن به اینکه کسی احتمالاً مرتکب جرم شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Who do you suspect?","translation":"به چه کسی مشکوک هستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602933.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s suspected of murder.","translation":"او مظنون به قتل است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602936.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pilcher was suspected of giving away government secrets to the enemy.","translation":"پیلچر مظنون بود که اسرار دولتی را به دشمن داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602939.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('3112c9c4-ae19-5ed4-ad3f-89441265c1ca','754d99f6-57c4-54e2-bfe9-f17ca6e26cb7',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that something is not honest or true',null,null,'فکر کردن به اینکه چیزی صادقانه یا واقعی نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I began to suspect his motives in inviting me.","translation":"به انگیزه های او در دعوت من مشکوک شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602943.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('755f7c4e-b140-59be-a9bd-4e5414ffb505','eddb1af4-914b-5381-96dc-c5064633c8c0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is thought to be guilty of a crime',null,null,'کسی که تصور می شود مرتکب جرم شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the prime/chief/main suspect She didn’t realise he was the prime suspect in a murder case.','the number one suspect (= the main suspect ) I was the one who found her. And that makes me the number one suspect for her murder.','a murder/burglary etc suspect The murder suspect is described as in his early 20s, wearing a baseball type cap and a dark jacket.','a possible suspect The police drew up a list of possible suspects.','arrest/detain a suspect Detectives arrested the suspect after a five-day undercover operation.','question/interrogate/interview a suspect Police confirmed that six suspects are being questioned.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Two suspects were arrested today in connection with the robbery.","translation":"دو مظنون در ارتباط با این سرقت امروز دستگیر شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602956.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police have issued a description of the murder suspect.","translation":"پلیس توضیحاتی درباره مظنون قتل صادر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577242.mp3"},{"sentence":"the two suspects for the robbery","translation":"دو مظنون این سرقت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577248.mp3"},{"sentence":"a suspect in a burglary case","translation":"مظنون پرونده سرقت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577251.mp3"},{"sentence":"Davies is still the chief suspect.","translation":"دیویس هنوز مظنون اصلی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577254.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('f3de73b5-2e8d-52a9-863a-f738edfa6b09','eddb1af4-914b-5381-96dc-c5064633c8c0',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the usual suspects',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the prime/chief/main suspect She didn’t realise he was the prime suspect in a murder case.','the number one suspect (= the main suspect ) I was the one who found her. And that makes me the number one suspect for her murder.','a murder/burglary etc suspect The murder suspect is described as in his early 20s, wearing a baseball type cap and a dark jacket.','a possible suspect The police drew up a list of possible suspects.','arrest/detain a suspect Detectives arrested the suspect after a five-day undercover operation.','question/interrogate/interview a suspect Police confirmed that six suspects are being questioned.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('21ea7d84-fdd3-5d8c-8502-19b5063eb9ae','6f2be1d9-642e-5c85-9e1a-f35c569bd5fd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not likely to be completely honest',null,null,'به احتمال زیاد کاملا صادق نیست',array['dodgy']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve always thought he was a bit of a suspect character.","translation":"من همیشه فکر می کردم که او یک شخصیت مشکوک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577255.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company was involved in some highly suspect business dealings.","translation":"این شرکت در برخی معاملات تجاری مشکوک شرکت داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577256.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5b0d1a59-b463-5065-b4ef-d45285709945','6f2be1d9-642e-5c85-9e1a-f35c569bd5fd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','not likely to be completely true',null,null,'به احتمال زیاد کاملا درست نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The two men were convicted on the basis of some highly suspect evidence.","translation":"این دو مرد بر اساس برخی شواهد بسیار مشکوک محکوم شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577262.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
