کز بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644979.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('bfd92b6d-9fde-565e-a501-bfa3d763b903','98cc541d-5da1-5f08-bccf-5b9c35769d97',5,'caring about something','اهمیت دادن به چیزی','spoken & written','a feeling of worrying or caring about something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'احساس نگرانی یا اهمیت دادن به چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a thought I just had a funny thought.','express your thoughts (= say what they are or tell other people about them ) He was finding it difficult to express his thoughts.','a thought occurs to/comes to/strikes somebody (= someone suddenly has a thought ) The thought occurred to him that she might be lying.','a thought crosses somebody’s mind (= someone has a thought ) The thought never crossed my mind that I could be wrong.','can’t bear the thought of something I can’t bear the thought of you being hurt.','somebody’s thoughts turn to something (= they start thinking about something ) As summer approaches, people’s thoughts turn to holidays.','somebody’s first thought My first thought was that a bomb had gone off.','a passing thought (= a quick, not very serious thought ) He never gives his appearance more than a passing thought.','a sobering thought (= one that makes you feel serious ) We have the power to destroy the world, which is a sobering thought.','horrible/disturbing A horrible thought struck her: could he be having an affair?','a comforting thought ‘People might not have noticed we’re late.’ ‘That’s a comforting thought.’','a sudden thought A sudden thought struck her and she began to laugh.','the very thought (= even the idea of doing something ) The very thought of going on stage made her feel ill.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He went back into the burning building with no thought for his own safety.","translation":"او بدون هیچ فکری برای امنیت خود به ساختمان در حال سوختن بازگشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566604.mp3"},{"sentence":"Have you no thought for anyone but yourself?","translation":"آیا جز خودت به هیچکس فکر نمیکنی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644984.mp3"},{"sentence":"You are always in my thoughts (= used to tell someone that you think and care about them a lot ) .","translation":"تو همیشه در افکار من هستی (= به کسی میگفتی که خیلی بهش فکر میکنی و بهش اهمیت میدی ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644985.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
