('c1ba0842-de89-57d8-b80e-54d3aa4c19d9','d0cacbb1-6cce-5dc6-ab3c-8b571acfea6b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','different from what is usual or normal',null,null,'عجیب، غیرمعمول؛ غیرعادی (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['very/most/highly unusual Gandhi was a most unusual politician.','extremely unusual We’ve not had any snow yet, which is extremely unusual.','rather/somewhat/quite/fairly unusual The design of the house was somewhat unusual.','nothing unusual There is nothing unusual about the arrangement.','something unusual We want to know if anyone saw something unusual last night.','anything unusual Did you notice anything unusual about him?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an unusual feature","translation":"یک ویژگی غیر معمول","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000524766.mp3"},{"sentence":"unusual circumstances","translation":"شرایط غیر معمول","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001601918.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s unusual for Dave to be late.","translation":"دیر رسیدن دیو غیرعادی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001601919.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s not unusual (= it is quite common ) to feel very angry in a situation like this.","translation":"غیرعادی نیست (= کاملاً معمول است) در چنین موقعیتی احساس خشم شدید کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001601922.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('8b848a05-f622-5454-a8e6-b36da34c1f3b','b2736296-0dd1-50c4-b336-b42d7c1501b0',1,null,null,'spoken','if something used to happen , it happened regularly or all the time in the past , but does not happen now',null,null,'قبلاً (عادت داشتن)، می‌رفت (گذشته عادتی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He used to go to our school.","translation":"او به مدرسه ما می رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813322.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re eating out more often than we used to.","translation":"ما بیشتر از قبل بیرون غذا می خوریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813323.mp3"},{"sentence":"You didn’t use to eat chips when you were younger.","translation":"شما در جوانی از خوردن چیپس استفاده نمی کردید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813326.mp3"},{"sentence":"You used not to fuss like this.","translation":"قبلا اینجوری غوغا نمیکردی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813330.mp3"},{"sentence":"It never used to bother me.","translation":"هیچ وقت اذیتم نمی کرد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001681.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you use to go to church regularly?","translation":"آیا مرتب به کلیسا می رفتید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813333.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('a670f95d-3d5b-599c-b411-c06ef15894c9','b2736296-0dd1-50c4-b336-b42d7c1501b0',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if a particular situation used to exist , it existed for a period of time in the past, but does not exist now',null,null,'اگر موقعیت خاصی وجود داشت، در گذشته برای مدتی وجود داشته است، اما اکنون وجود ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Jimmy used to be a friend of mine.","translation":"جیمی قبلا دوست من بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813334.mp3"},{"sentence":"There used to be a large car park on this site.","translation":"قبلا یک پارکینگ بزرگ در این سایت وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620236.mp3"},{"sentence":"Why are you so bad-tempered? You didn’t use to be like this.","translation":"چرا اینقدر بداخلاق هستی؟ قبلا اینجوری نبودی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813337.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did this building use to be a hotel?","translation":"آیا این ساختمان قبلا هتل بوده است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813340.mp3"},{"sentence":"Where did you use to live before you came to Manchester?","translation":"قبل از اینکه به منچستر بیایید کجا زندگی می کردید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813341.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('a9ffaf88-76fa-5e69-9f99-789bbbff8a6f','28322799-afd7-563e-a7b7-a38242b15690',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to talk about what happens on most occasions or in most situations',null,null,'معمولاً، به‌طور معمول؛ اغلب',array['generally']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Women usually live longer than men.","translation":"زنان معمولا بیشتر از مردان عمر می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000531357.mp3"},{"sentence":"Usually I wear black, grey, or brown.","translation":"معمولا مشکی، خاکستری یا قهوه ای می پوشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000512430.mp3"},{"sentence":"The drive usually takes 15 or 20 minutes.","translation":"رانندگی معمولاً 15 یا 20 دقیقه طول می کشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620329.mp3"},{"sentence":"She usually takes the bus.","translation":"او معمولا سوار اتوبوس می شود.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Usually she takes the bus.","translation":"معمولاً او سوار اتوبوس می شود.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"She is usually late.","translation":"او معمولا دیر می شود.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"I don’t usually come here.","translation":"من معمولا اینجا نمیام","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('f786b8c7-c05c-5232-b8c9-1c845cd42f4f','14358e18-e96d-59c8-936c-5b951fc234b0',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'a variety of something','تنوع، گوناگونی؛ تنوع (فرهنگی)؛ تنوع (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a wide/great/large variety They hold debates on a wide variety of topics.','a huge/enormous variety Fruit is eaten by a huge variety of animals and birds.','an infinite/endless variety There is a seemingly infinite variety of beers to choose from.','a rich variety A rich variety of plants grows here.','a bewildering variety (= so many that you feel confused ) There is a bewildering variety of roses to choose from.','an amazing variety The market has an amazing variety of fresh fish.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3a593e50-4302-50fe-95b7-910eb84f2db3','14358e18-e96d-59c8-936c-5b951fc234b0',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the differences within a group, set of actions etc that make it interesting','[ uncountable ]',null,'تفاوت های درون یک گروه، مجموعه ای از اقدامات و غیره که آن را جالب می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a wide/great/large variety They hold debates on a wide variety of topics.','a huge/enormous variety Fruit is eaten by a huge variety of animals and birds.','an infinite/endless variety There is a seemingly infinite variety of beers to choose from.','a rich variety A rich variety of plants grows here.','a bewildering variety (= so many that you feel confused ) There is a bewildering variety of roses to choose from.','an amazing variety The market has an amazing variety of fresh fish.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I really like the variety the store has to offer.","translation":"من واقعاً تنوعی که فروشگاه ارائه می دهد را دوست دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664945.mp3"},{"sentence":"Occasionally working from home adds variety to a job.","translation":"گاهی اوقات کار کردن در خانه تنوع شغلی را افزایش می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664949.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('cc82e4c0-d2ad-54b6-8bc3-698d7836f166','14358e18-e96d-59c8-936c-5b951fc234b0',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a type of thing, such as a plant or animal, that is different from others in the same group','[ countable ]',null,'یک نوع چیز، مانند یک گیاه یا حیوان، که با دیگران در همان گروه متفاوت است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a wide/great/large variety They hold debates on a wide variety of topics.','a huge/enormous variety Fruit is eaten by a huge variety of animals and birds.','an infinite/endless variety There is a seemingly infinite variety of beers to choose from.','a rich variety A rich variety of plants grows here.','a bewildering variety (= so many that you feel confused ) There is a bewildering variety of roses to choose from.','an amazing variety The market has an amazing variety of fresh fish.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The lake has more than 20 varieties of fish.","translation":"این دریاچه بیش از 20 نوع ماهی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664950.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bf0742c9-8c3b-51bd-93d2-769b10d2a796','14358e18-e96d-59c8-936c-5b951fc234b0',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a particular type of person or thing – often used humorously','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'نوع خاصی از شخص یا چیز - اغلب به صورت طنز استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a wide/great/large variety They hold debates on a wide variety of topics.','a huge/enormous variety Fruit is eaten by a huge variety of animals and birds.','an infinite/endless variety There is a seemingly infinite variety of beers to choose from.','a rich variety A rich variety of plants grows here.','a bewildering variety (= so many that you feel confused ) There is a bewildering variety of roses to choose from.','an amazing variety The market has an amazing variety of fresh fish.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Lon has no patience with anything of the child variety.","translation":"لون با هیچ چیز از انواع کودک صبر نمی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664956.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f7cc95d8-080c-5ec4-a5fd-eb32280dc3d6','14358e18-e96d-59c8-936c-5b951fc234b0',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'variety is the spice of life','تنوع، گوناگونی؛ تنوع (فرهنگی)؛ تنوع (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a wide/great/large variety They hold debates on a wide variety of topics.','a huge/enormous variety Fruit is eaten by a huge variety of animals and birds.','an infinite/endless variety There is a seemingly infinite variety of beers to choose from.','a rich variety A rich variety of plants grows here.','a bewildering variety (= so many that you feel confused ) There is a bewildering variety of roses to choose from.','an amazing variety The market has an amazing variety of fresh fish.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f4f46eb8-79c5-59c9-9767-8872dd22b22a','85a9d8d8-0cdd-5802-8d86-62828f95a934',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if there are various things, there are several different types of that thing',null,null,'گوناگون، مختلف؛ متعدد (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The jacket is available in various colours.","translation":"ژاکت در رنگ های مختلف موجود است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001542239.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are various ways to answer your question.","translation":"راه های مختلفی برای پاسخ به سوال شما وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664654.mp3"},{"sentence":"He decided to leave school for various reasons .","translation":"او به دلایل مختلف تصمیم گرفت مدرسه را ترک کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664655.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('97092779-9a47-5cd5-8aa7-0de4527f11a5','85a9d8d8-0cdd-5802-8d86-62828f95a934',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'many and various','گوناگون، مختلف؛ متعدد (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('9442eadd-1ed7-5f6b-97b9-c71dc2e2ada4','4c20bf1a-4c80-538c-86aa-9d87d1367ee2',1,null,null,'formal','a machine with an engine that is used to take people or things from one place to another, such as a car, bus , or truck',null,null,'وسیله، خودرو؛ وسیله (نقل)؛ وسیله (حمل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a description of the stolen vehicle","translation":"شرح خودروی سرقتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001548605.mp3"},{"sentence":"Have you locked your vehicle?","translation":"آیا وسیله نقلیه خود را قفل کرده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592523.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('89e54e4b-64c9-5531-a7ae-39ab0850d202','4c20bf1a-4c80-538c-86aa-9d87d1367ee2',2,null,null,'formal','something you use to express and spread your ideas, opinions etc','[ usually singular ]',null,'چیزی که برای بیان و انتشار ایده ها، نظرات و غیره استفاده می کنید',array['medium']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The 1936 Olympics were used as a vehicle for Nazi propaganda.","translation":"المپیک 1936 به عنوان وسیله ای برای تبلیغات نازی ها مورد استفاده قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592528.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3d7cf665-14ba-575a-8f19-ad53b65e1889','4c20bf1a-4c80-538c-86aa-9d87d1367ee2',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a film , television programme etc that is made to gain public attention for one of the people in it','[ usually singular ]',null,'یک فیلم، برنامه تلویزیونی و غیره که برای جلب توجه عمومی برای یکی از افراد در آن ساخته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"This is the perfect vehicle for Fleming to make his triumphant return to the stage.","translation":"این وسیله ای عالی برای فلمینگ برای بازگشت پیروزمندانه خود به صحنه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592535.mp3"},{"sentence":"MGM made the film as a star vehicle for Brando.","translation":"MGM این فیلم را به عنوان یک وسیله نقلیه ستاره برای براندو ساخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592536.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('40dce342-8b9c-538c-a3d9-1f246f8ff88d','b03af7aa-bcec-5f84-996a-55f3bcf0a894',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a copy of something that has been changed so that it is slightly different',null,null,'نسخه، ویرایش؛ نسخه (فیلم)؛ نسخه (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a new version There has been an outcry over a new version of the world’s most popular ballet.','a different version The two groups listened to different versions of the story.','the latest version The company will soon release the latest version of its network operating system.','the original/first version The original version was in Latin but later editions were in English.','the final version The final version of the report omitted these criticisms.','an earlier version The president vetoed an earlier version of the bill.','a later version a later version of the software','the film version (= a film of a book or play ) He appeared in the film version of ''Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince''.','a revised version In a revised version of the script, this scene was cut .','a modified version (= one that has some small changes ) The article is a modified version of a paper that first appeared in an academic journal.','an updated version an updated version of the ''Best Pub'' guide','a simplified version This simplified version of Shakespeare’s play is intended for younger children.','an improved version The manufacturers come up with new, improved versions each year.','an abridged version (= one that is shortened from the original but not changed in any other way ) Reader’s Digest published abridged versions of many popular novels.','the unabridged version (= not shortened – used when this version is long ) the unabridged version of ''Moby Dick''','the uncut version (= used about a film that includes parts that were not in the film when it was shown in cinemas ) the uncut version of ''Bladerunner''']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a new version of the software","translation":"نسخه جدید نرم افزار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543691.mp3"},{"sentence":"the original version of the text","translation":"نسخه اصلی متن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592963.mp3"},{"sentence":"a Japanese version of an English play","translation":"نسخه ژاپنی یک نمایشنامه انگلیسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592970.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think I preferred the television version.","translation":"فکر می کنم نسخه تلویزیونی را ترجیح می دادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592971.mp3"},{"sentence":"the human version of mad cow disease","translation":"نسخه انسانی بیماری جنون گاوی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592972.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('b7f733db-3cbd-511e-807d-b62aece32c49','b03af7aa-bcec-5f84-996a-55f3bcf0a894',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone’s version of an event is their description of it, when this is different from the description given by another person',null,null,'نسخه شخصی از یک رویداد، توصیف او از آن است، زمانی که این با توصیف ارائه شده توسط شخص دیگری متفاوت است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a new version There has been an outcry over a new version of the world’s most popular ballet.','a different version The two groups listened to different versions of the story.','the latest version The company will soon release the latest version of its network operating system.','the original/first version The original version was in Latin but later editions were in English.','the final version The final version of the report omitted these criticisms.','an earlier version The president vetoed an earlier version of the bill.','a later version a later version of the software','the film version (= a film of a book or play ) He appeared in the film version of ''Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince''.','a revised version In a revised version of the script, this scene was cut .','a modified version (= one that has some small changes ) The article is a modified version of a paper that first appeared in an academic journal.','an updated version an updated version of the ''Best Pub'' guide','a simplified version This simplified version of Shakespeare’s play is intended for younger children.','an improved version The manufacturers come up with new, improved versions each year.','an abridged version (= one that is shortened from the original but not changed in any other way ) Reader’s Digest published abridged versions of many popular novels.','the unabridged version (= not shortened – used when this version is long ) the unabridged version of ''Moby Dick''','the uncut version (= used about a film that includes parts that were not in the film when it was shown in cinemas ) the uncut version of ''Bladerunner''']::text[],'[{"sentence":"according to the official version of events","translation":"طبق نسخه رسمی رویدادها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543700.mp3"},{"sentence":"Could Donna’s version of what happened that night be correct?","translation":"آیا نسخه دونا از اتفاقی که در آن شب افتاد می‌تواند درست باشد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001694.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('436eddd7-0953-5eb4-a291-ee0c2af4a9b5','b03af7aa-bcec-5f84-996a-55f3bcf0a894',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the ... version of something','نسخه، ویرایش؛ نسخه (فیلم)؛ نسخه (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a new version There has been an outcry over a new version of the world’s most popular ballet.','a different version The two groups listened to different versions of the story.','the latest version The company will soon release the latest version of its network operating system.','the original/first version The original version was in Latin but later editions were in English.','the final version The final version of the report omitted these criticisms.','an earlier version The president vetoed an earlier version of the bill.','a later version a later version of the software','the film version (= a film of a book or play ) He appeared in the film version of ''Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince''.','a revised version In a revised version of the script, this scene was cut .','a modified version (= one that has some small changes ) The article is a modified version of a paper that first appeared in an academic journal.','an updated version an updated version of the ''Best Pub'' guide','a simplified version This simplified version of Shakespeare’s play is intended for younger children.','an improved version The manufacturers come up with new, improved versions each year.','an abridged version (= one that is shortened from the original but not changed in any other way ) Reader’s Digest published abridged versions of many popular novels.','the unabridged version (= not shortened – used when this version is long ) the unabridged version of ''Moby Dick''','the uncut version (= used about a film that includes parts that were not in the film when it was shown in cinemas ) the uncut version of ''Bladerunner''']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('35dc1592-6981-5eeb-b9a2-9b37789a53b7','bc68bfdc-4033-52d2-a1d9-bee9e5230df5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a situation in which you win a battle , game , election , or dispute',null,null,'پیروزی، فتح؛ پیروزی (انتخابات)؛ پیروزی (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a great/major victory He said the court’s decision was a great victory.','an easy victory Arsenal expected an easy victory.','a decisive victory The battle was a decisive victory for the US.','a landslide victory (= a win by a very large amount in an election ) No one had anticipated such a landslide victory.','a crushing victory (= a win by a very large amount ) Australia won a crushing 139-run victory over the West Indies.','a narrow victory (= a win by a small amount ) A general election on Oct. 5 produced a narrow victory for the People’s Progressive Party.','an election/electoral victory The Democrats were celebrating their election victory.','a military victory one of the General’s most famous military victories','a moral victory (= when you show your beliefs are right, even if you lose the argument ) The victims’ families claimed the verdict as a moral victory.','win/score a victory Today we have won an important victory.','lead somebody to victory She led her team to victory in the finals.','clinch victory (= finally win ) Adams scored a last-minute goal to clinch victory.','pull off a victory (= win when it is difficult ) Martin pulled off a surprise victory in the semi-final.','sweep to victory (= win easily ) Nixon swept to victory by 47 million votes to 29 million.','victory celebrations The victory celebrations went on all night.','a victory parade They intend to hold a victory parade.','a victory lap (= when a winning runner or player runs around the playing area ) He then took a victory lap around the arena.','a string of victories (= a series of victories ) The team won a string of victories.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the Raiders’ 35–17 victory over St Louis","translation":"پیروزی 35–17 رایدرز مقابل سنت لوئیس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943266.mp3"},{"sentence":"The court’s decision represents a victory for all women.","translation":"تصمیم دادگاه نشان دهنده یک پیروزی برای همه زنان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020317.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5088b653-d1af-5725-bbdf-7246c3fb82a2','3fd25f95-34f4-5f6b-a968-96e0d28070b4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a very small town in the countryside',null,null,'روستا، دهکده؛ روستا (خاک)؛ روستا (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['small/little/tiny They come from a small village in Laos.','pretty/picturesque There are many pretty villages nearby.','remote (= one that is far away from larger towns ) We need to get food aid to the more remote villages.','quiet/sleepy (= one where there is not a lot of activity ) Downham was a sleepy little village, with a road barely wide enough for one car.','a fishing village Once a fishing village, this is now a friendly, lively international resort.','a mountain/hilltop village The paths lead to picturesque mountain villages.','the village hall/school/shop/church A meeting will be held at the village hall on Tuesday.','the village green (= area of grass for everyone to use ) a cricket match on the village green','village life (= all the activities in a village ) She had always taken an active part in village life.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a little fishing village","translation":"یک دهکده ماهیگیری کوچک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001640250.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
