('6e6e1b80-de0d-5c38-aa8c-d455505b39ef','f2c66f1d-c079-5bc2-a02d-1bcaffe1d9d6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','involving actions that are intended to injure or kill people, by hitting them, shooting them etc',null,null,'خشن، تند (برخورد)؛ خشونت‌آمیز (فیلم)؛ پرقوا (طوفان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a violent crime He has a number of convictions for violent crime.','a violent attack Blacks were more often victims of violent attacks than other ethnic groups.','a violent death No French king died a violent death during this period.','a violent clash There were violent clashes between police and protesters.','a violent incident Violent incidents such as kidnapping dropped sharply last year.','violent acts/behaviour His dad terrified them all with his violent behaviour.','a violent protest/demonstration This incident sparked violent demonstrations outside the airbase.','very/extremely violent an extremely violent attack','increasingly violent Over the past year, his behavior has become increasingly violent.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the increase in violent crime","translation":"افزایش جرایم خشن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001640356.mp3"},{"sentence":"violent clashes between the police and demonstrators","translation":"درگیری شدید بین پلیس و تظاهرکنندگان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001550222.mp3"},{"sentence":"Thirty-one people have been injured in violent incidents throughout the day.","translation":"31 نفر در حوادث خشونت آمیز در طول روز مجروح شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00954.mp3"},{"sentence":"The riots ended in the violent deaths of three teenagers.","translation":"این ناآرامی ها به مرگ خشونت آمیز سه نوجوان ختم شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001640365.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
