('4308a7fe-b1ac-5e7d-ac2c-ca78ba86096f','f2c66f1d-c079-5bc2-a02d-1bcaffe1d9d6',8,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely bright',null,null,'فوق العاده روشن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a violent crime He has a number of convictions for violent crime.','a violent attack Blacks were more often victims of violent attacks than other ethnic groups.','a violent death No French king died a violent death during this period.','a violent clash There were violent clashes between police and protesters.','a violent incident Violent incidents such as kidnapping dropped sharply last year.','violent acts/behaviour His dad terrified them all with his violent behaviour.','a violent protest/demonstration This incident sparked violent demonstrations outside the airbase.','very/extremely violent an extremely violent attack','increasingly violent Over the past year, his behavior has become increasingly violent.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her cheeks turned a violent red colour.","translation":"گونه هایش به رنگ قرمز خشن درآمدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001550269.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f40db1ef-72be-52ae-bf25-5b6730d35b6e','fe607db2-2033-59c2-886c-c471dd58e087',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is visible can be seen',null,null,'مشاهده‌پذیر، مرئی؛ مشهود (نظرات)؛ مرئی (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['clearly/plainly visible The fracture was clearly visible on the X-ray.','highly visible Cyclists should wear highly visible colours.','easily visible By July 26, Mercury should be easily visible in the evening sky.','barely/hardly visible The parked car was barely visible in the darkness.','visible to the naked eye (= able to be seen without using special equipment ) The comet is now visible to the naked eye.','a visible sign He considered the expensive car a visible sign of his achievement.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The outline of the mountains was clearly visible.","translation":"طرح کلی کوه ها به وضوح قابل مشاهده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639829.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sign was clearly visible to passing motorists.","translation":"تابلو به وضوح برای رانندگان عبوری قابل مشاهده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639832.mp3"},{"sentence":"The comet is visible to the naked eye (= can be seen without using special equipment ) .","translation":"دنباله دار با چشم غیرمسلح قابل مشاهده است (= بدون استفاده از تجهیزات خاص قابل مشاهده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639833.mp3"},{"sentence":"Check the plant for any visible signs of disease.","translation":"گیاه را برای هر گونه علائم قابل مشاهده بیماری بررسی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639838.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('89b242f6-55ca-5ae5-9185-5084216ce67d','fe607db2-2033-59c2-886c-c471dd58e087',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an effect that is visible is great enough to be noticed',null,null,'اثری که قابل مشاهده است به اندازه کافی عالی است که قابل توجه باشد',array['noticeable']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['clearly/plainly visible The fracture was clearly visible on the X-ray.','highly visible Cyclists should wear highly visible colours.','easily visible By July 26, Mercury should be easily visible in the evening sky.','barely/hardly visible The parked car was barely visible in the darkness.','visible to the naked eye (= able to be seen without using special equipment ) The comet is now visible to the naked eye.','a visible sign He considered the expensive car a visible sign of his achievement.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There has been a visible change in his attitude.","translation":"تغییر قابل توجهی در نگرش او ایجاد شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001545694.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ec99718d-0f85-5e38-bdd0-4b7a4488ec93','fe607db2-2033-59c2-886c-c471dd58e087',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is visible is in a situation in which a lot of people notice them',null,null,'کسی که قابل مشاهده است در موقعیتی است که افراد زیادی متوجه او می شوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['clearly/plainly visible The fracture was clearly visible on the X-ray.','highly visible Cyclists should wear highly visible colours.','easily visible By July 26, Mercury should be easily visible in the evening sky.','barely/hardly visible The parked car was barely visible in the darkness.','visible to the naked eye (= able to be seen without using special equipment ) The comet is now visible to the naked eye.','a visible sign He considered the expensive car a visible sign of his achievement.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"highly visible politicians","translation":"سیاستمداران بسیار قابل مشاهده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001545699.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ef5c2651-39d4-5a25-ba84-0a01235a9718','84f96fe5-44e0-5a53-9e3c-89a329a3b1bd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who comes to visit a place or a person',null,null,'بازدیدکننده، زائر؛ مهمان (مکان)؛ بازدیدکننده (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Times Square attracts more than 30 million visitors annually.","translation":"میدان تایمز سالانه بیش از 30 میلیون بازدید کننده را به خود جذب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001545786.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rina is a frequent visitor to the city.","translation":"رینا از بازدیدکنندگان مکرر شهر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639953.mp3"},{"sentence":"visitors from overseas","translation":"بازدیدکنندگان از خارج از کشور","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639956.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b39e992c-26bf-523b-a0b8-bfff68bd94eb','bcef164b-bf6b-53f4-be77-d021856fa601',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something, especially a statement , that tells you that something bad, dangerous , or annoying might happen so that you can be ready or avoid it','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'هشدار، اخطار؛ هشدار (برق)؛ هشدار (طبیعت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give a warning He slammed on the brakes without giving any warning.','issue a warning (= officially warn people ) The government issued a warning about eating raw eggs.','deliver/sound a warning (= give a public warning ) The chairman sounded a warning that jobs could be lost.','heed a warning (= take notice of it ) Drivers failed to heed warnings about fog.','ignore a warning He had ignored their warning to stay in the car.','advance/prior warning Workers were given no advance warning of the closure.','fair warning He was given fair warning that such behaviour would not be tolerated.','a stern warning I got a stern warning against giving false information to the police.','a stark warning Cigarette packets carry the stark warning ‘smoking kills’.','a health warning (= a warning that something is bad for your health ) All tobacco products must carry a health warning.','a flood/gale/tornado warning A flood warning has been issued for the River Wye in Herefordshire.','without (any) warning Police fired into the crowd without warning.','a word of warning (= used before telling someone to be careful about something ) A word of warning: don’t use too much glue.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a warning of floods","translation":"هشدار سیل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943059.mp3"},{"sentence":"warnings about the dangers of smoking","translation":"هشدار در مورد مضرات سیگار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943062.mp3"},{"sentence":"This experience should serve as a warning against complacency.","translation":"این تجربه باید به عنوان هشداری در برابر رضایتمندی عمل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001719.mp3"},{"sentence":"a warning to pregnant women not to drink alcohol","translation":"هشدار به زنان باردار برای عدم مصرف الکل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943068.mp3"},{"sentence":"a warning that grey squirrels are threatening the existence of red squirrels","translation":"هشداری مبنی بر اینکه سنجاب های خاکستری وجود سنجاب های قرمز را تهدید می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943069.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('cb586bab-8601-518f-b0cf-c4e31d06a32a','bcef164b-bf6b-53f4-be77-d021856fa601',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a statement telling someone that if they continue to behave in an unsatisfactory way, they will be punished','[ countable ]',null,'بیانیه ای که به کسی می گوید اگر به رفتار نامناسب ادامه دهد، مجازات خواهد شد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give a warning He slammed on the brakes without giving any warning.','issue a warning (= officially warn people ) The government issued a warning about eating raw eggs.','deliver/sound a warning (= give a public warning ) The chairman sounded a warning that jobs could be lost.','heed a warning (= take notice of it ) Drivers failed to heed warnings about fog.','ignore a warning He had ignored their warning to stay in the car.','advance/prior warning Workers were given no advance warning of the closure.','fair warning He was given fair warning that such behaviour would not be tolerated.','a stern warning I got a stern warning against giving false information to the police.','a stark warning Cigarette packets carry the stark warning ‘smoking kills’.','a health warning (= a warning that something is bad for your health ) All tobacco products must carry a health warning.','a flood/gale/tornado warning A flood warning has been issued for the River Wye in Herefordshire.','without (any) warning Police fired into the crowd without warning.','a word of warning (= used before telling someone to be careful about something ) A word of warning: don’t use too much glue.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Surrey team were given a warning last year for repeated offences.","translation":"تیم ساری سال گذشته به دلیل تخلفات مکرر اخطار داده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001618911.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m giving you a final warning – don’t be late again.","translation":"من آخرین هشدار را به شما می دهم - دیگر دیر نکنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000538842.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('71d40808-4d74-57c1-a965-9e08e66f03cb','05a72bff-8e42-5881-ab09-5857b5125c58',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a warning action or thing tells you that something bad or dangerous might happen',null,null,'یک اقدام یا چیز هشدار دهنده به شما می گوید که ممکن است اتفاق بد یا خطرناکی رخ دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a warning sign Don’t ignore the warning signs of stress.','a warning shot Troops fired warning shots over the heads of demonstrators.','a warning light Red warning lights were flashing.','a warning look/glance She gave me a warning look, but I carried on.','a warning gesture He put his finger to his lips in a warning gesture.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Red warning lights were flashing.","translation":"چراغ‌های هشدار قرمز چشمک می‌زدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001720.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government ignored all the warning signs .","translation":"دولت تمام علائم هشدار دهنده را نادیده گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040306.mp3"},{"sentence":"She said nothing but gave him a warning look.","translation":"چیزی نگفت اما نگاهی هشدار دهنده به او انداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040307.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('cc8e90fb-acc6-594f-9502-28bf5e1e8d18','05a72bff-8e42-5881-ab09-5857b5125c58',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'warning bell/bells',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a warning sign Don’t ignore the warning signs of stress.','a warning shot Troops fired warning shots over the heads of demonstrators.','a warning light Red warning lights were flashing.','a warning look/glance She gave me a warning look, but I carried on.','a warning gesture He put his finger to his lips in a warning gesture.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('5e0a924f-0a71-526e-85a1-e17658dede70','7e5f0a3d-a66b-5eca-8dd6-5bf5e87c299a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','clothes that need to be washed , are being washed, or have just been washed',null,null,'شست‌وشو، لگن (شست)؛ شست‌وشو (پوشاک)؛ شستن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I really must do the washing (= wash the dirty clothes ) .","translation":"من واقعاً باید شستن را انجام دهم (= لباس های کثیف را بشوییم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619054.mp3"},{"sentence":"Could you put the washing out (= hang it on a washing line ) for me?","translation":"آیا می توانید شستشو را برای من بگذارید (= آن را روی خط لباسشویی آویزان کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619058.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1fb55342-436b-5110-94a4-a7ad65bdf592','f60f97b6-51ed-5729-bf34-112bd7e0232d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the temperature and other conditions such as sun , rain , and wind','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'آب‌وهوا، هوا؛ آب‌وهوا (طوفانی)؛ هوا (روز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['good/nice/lovely (= not wet ) We’ll go out if the weather is good.','glorious/beautiful/perfect It was glorious weather, so we decided to go for a picnic.','bad (= wet or stormy ) Several flights were cancelled owing to bad weather.','awful/dreadful/terrible weather We came home early because of the awful weather.','hot Drink lots of water in hot weather.','cold The weather was cold and grey.','fine/sunny/fair/dry If the weather is fine, we’ll eat outside. Water pot plants daily during spells of dry weather.','wet/rainy I’m so sick of this wet weather.','windy/stormy In windy weather, water from the fountain is blown onto the paths.','have good/bad etc weather We have had lovely weather all week.','the weather turns (= changes ) The weather had turned mild.','the weather holds (out) (= good weather continues in the same way ) The forecast said the weather should hold until Tuesday.','the weather breaks (= stops being good ) We got almost all the harvest in before the weather broke.','the weather forecast (= a description of what the weather is expected to be like in the near future ) What’s the weather forecast like for the weekend?','the weather map (= a map showing the current or expected future weather ) The weather map shows a band of rain coming in from the east.','weather conditions (= whether it is raining or sunny ) The rescue was difficult because of the appalling weather conditions.','weather patterns (= the usual weather that comes at a particular time each year ) Changes in weather patterns are thought to be caused by global warming','a weather station (= a place used for studying and recording weather conditions )','a weather centre British English , a weather bureau American English (= a place where information about the weather is collected and where reports are produced ) The London Weather Centre has issued a warning that there could be extremely heavy rain and high winds over the next 24 hours.','weather permitting (= if the weather is good enough ) Breakfast is served on the terrace, weather permitting.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What’s the weather like today?","translation":"امروز هوا چطوره؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001984022.mp3"},{"sentence":"The weather turned bitterly cold.","translation":"هوا به شدت سرد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001984026.mp3"},{"sentence":"The weather seems to be getting worse.","translation":"به نظر می رسد هوا در حال بدتر شدن است.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"We had good weather all week.","translation":"تمام هفته هوای خوبی داشتیم.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Games are sometimes cancelled because of bad weather.","translation":"بازی ها گاهی اوقات به دلیل آب و هوای بد لغو می شوند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
