 where reports are produced ) The London Weather Centre has issued a warning that there could be extremely heavy rain and high winds over the next 24 hours.','weather permitting (= if the weather is good enough ) Breakfast is served on the terrace, weather permitting.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
